  Activity_116818_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "The event has ended."
  },
  Activity_116818_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title: Against the Doom: II>
"Against the Doom: II" features 7 non-rechallengable stages that directly confront the Primordial Vision. One stage opens on the first two days respectively, three stages open on the third day, and one additional stage unlocks each day thereafter.
Each time you defeat the corresponding Astral Primordial Vision, you will receive a reward.
Each type of Astral Primordial Vision has numerous Avatars. When any type is defeated by a Keeper, its "Residual Count" decreases by 1. Once the Residual Count reaches zero, that stage closes permanently.
Each stage provides different Relics, granting you powerful bonuses.
All stages require an Assist. Each Keeper you follow can only assist you once throughout the event. Using an Assist increases the final Affinity reward by an additional 50% of the base reward.
Each Awakener, WoD, and Posse may only be deployed once every day.
Keepers must have completed Investigation 2-9 to participate in this event.

<Title: Level Compensation>
"Against the Doom: II" includes a Level Compensation system to ensure all Keepers can fight side-by-side!
The compensation rules are as follows:
In the investigation team, Awakener bodies below level 60 will be compensated to Level 60 for the challenge.
Awakener skill levels below 5 will be compensated to Level 5 for the challenge.
Awakener "Madness Omen" levels below 6 will be compensated to Level 6 for the challenge.
Awakener "Soulforge Aptitude" levels below 5 will be compensated to Level 5 for the challenge.
If your Keeper level is below 60, it will be compensated to Level 60 for the challenge.

<Title: Special Ops>
1. The "Special Ops: Celestial Aria" event can be unlocked for free during the event period.
2. After the event ends, your investigation progress for "Special Ops: Celestial Aria" is retained. You can still earn event rewards by completing any unfinished investigation events. If you did not unlock the Special Ops during the event, you must first clear "Investigation- Astral Reign- Chapter Four" and consume 7 "Reality Verge" to unlock "Celestial Aria."
3. Whether during the event or afterward, clearing "Special Ops: Celestial Aria" will grant you the "Posse: Reunion Wish."]]
