  Activity_122520_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event, Keepers can collect event currency through the limited-time gameplay "Witch's Shop" and "Achievement Rewards." The event currency can be exchanged in the "Witch's Vault" for item rewards, including the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "Witch's Wide Brim Hat," Philosopher's Stone, Pure Core, Luminous Core, and more. 
2. During the event, "Special Ops: Shadow of Rainy Town" will be available for free, and completing event achievements will also reward you with the event-exclusive avatar "By the Silver Key: Daffodil"!

<Title:Event Time>
1. January 12, 9:00 AM - January 26, 9:00 AM (GMT+8), all event content is available for participation. 
2. January 26, 9:00 AM - February 2, 9:00 AM (GMT+8), only "Witch's Vault" and "Achievement Rewards" will remain available, while other content will have ended and cannot be participated in. 

<Title: Witch's Shop>
1. "Witch's Shop" consists of 5 levels, with one level automatically unlocking every 2 days. 
2. Each challenge will consume 120 points of Neuropeptide, and successful challenges will reward event currency. 
3. After completing a level, the "Reenact" feature for that level will be unlocked. Please note: using the "Reenact" feature will not yield synchronization rates. 
4. You can use Alumni Assistance to help you clear levels more easily. 

<Title: Event Bonus>
1. Keepers who possess specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be deployed) can receive additional drop bonuses for "Pale Beast Skull," "Shadowy Beast Skull," and "Crimson Beast Skull" rewards in the "Witch's Shop" quest, with specific bonuses as follows: 
 Awakener "Daffodil": Awakening 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50% 
 SSR Wheel "Most Precious Collection": Ascension 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50% 
 SR Wheel "Witch's Wide Brim Hat": Ascension 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50% 
2. Different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny's "Event Bonuses" are calculated cumulatively. 
3. Notably, the first completion rewards for the Frenzied Difficulty challenge will not be affected by "Event Bonuses." 

<Title: Witch's Vault>
1. There are three "Witch's Vaults," with the following opening times: 
 "Worry-Relief Goods": January 12, 9:00 AM - February 2, 9:00 AM. 
 "Gorgeous Treasures": January 14, 9:00 AM - February 2, 9:00 AM. 
 "Collectible Curios": January 16, 9:00 AM - February 2, 9:00 AM. 
2. Each exchange will consume 750 "Pale Beast Skull"/"Shadowy Beast Skull"/"Crimson Beast Skull," randomly granting five item rewards from the vault. 
3. The item rewards from each vault are divided into "Special Items" and "Common Items." During resets, the remaining quantity of specified item rewards can be reset to the maximum limit, with specific rules as follows: 
(1) For the first two resets: When there are no remaining "Special Items," the Keeper may choose to reset. After resetting, both "Special Items" and "Common Items" remaining quantities will be reset to the maximum limit; alternatively, the Keeper may choose to continue exchanging, and when there are also no remaining "Common Items," a reset must be performed to continue exchanging. 
(2) Starting from the third reset: A reset can only be performed when there are no remaining "Common Items," which will reset the remaining quantity of "Common Items" to the maximum limit, while "Special Items" will no longer be reset. 

<Title: Special Ops>
1. During the event, "Special Ops: Shadow of Rainy Town" will be available for free. 
2. After the event ends, the investigation progress for "Special Ops: Shadow of Rainy Town" will be retained. If "Special Ops: Shadow of Rainy Town" was not unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked after the event by consuming "Reality Starting Point" *7. 
3. Regardless of whether during the event, completing "Special Ops: Shadow of Rainy Town" will grant "Key: True Appearance of Gray Mist."]]
