  Activity_124801_ActivityTips = {
    Text = "<Title:Event Overview>\n1. During the event, Keepers can participate in \"Traphase\" to complete achievements in \"Achievement Rewards\" and claim \"Magic Acorns.\"\n2. \"Magic Acorns\" can be used to claim abundant rewards in \"Round Wonders,\" including the event-exclusive avatar \"My Turn: Cosmic Card,\" 10 event-exclusive emotes, as well as \"Dreamshard,\" \"Dreamspark,\" and more.\n3. During the event, \"Multidimensional Connection: My Turn\" will be available for free!\n4. During the event, Keepers who have cleared \"Multidimensional Connection: My Turn: Outlander's Visit\" will have the \"Traphase\" battle background temporarily replaced with \"My Turn: Mindscape.\"\n\n<Title: Achievement Rewards>\n1. \"Achievement Rewards\" includes \"Arcane Trial,\" \"Honor Trial,\" and \"Threshold Trial.\" Keepers can complete achievement objectives to claim \"Magic Acorns.\"\n2. In the \"Arcane Trial\" achievements, every 3 enemy Awakeners defeated earns 10 \"Magic Acorns,\" up to 50 times. Every 6 Exalts unleashed earns 10 \"Magic Acorns,\" up to 50 times. Every 20 Cards played earns 10 \"Magic Acorns,\" up to 50 times.\n3. Awakeners, Wheels of Destiny, and Posses temporarily unlocked via Premium Topics will count normally toward victory counts and card-play counts.\n\n<Title: Round Wonders>\n1. Keepers can accumulate \"Magic Acorns\" to claim corresponding rewards. Accumulating 3,600 \"Magic Acorns\" unlocks all core rewards, and accumulating 6,000 \"Magic Acorns\" unlocks all rewards!\n2. Clearing \"My Turn: Outlander's Visit\" unlocks rewards for accumulating 100–900 \"Magic Acorns,\" and clearing \"My Turn: Cosmos Reforged\" unlocks rewards for accumulating 1,000–6,000 \"Magic Acorns.\"\n\n<Title: Multidimensional Connection>\n1. During the event, \"Multidimensional Connection: My Turn\" will be available for free.\n2. After the event ends, the investigation progress of \"Multidimensional Connection: My Turn\" will be retained. If \"Multidimensional Connection: My Turn\" was not unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked after the event ends by spending \"Reality Verge\" *3.\n3. Regardless of whether it is during the event period, clearing \"Multidimensional Connection: My Turn\" will reward \"Posse: Tavern's Opening.\"\n\n<Title:Event Duration>\nThis event is only available from March 16 at 9:00 AM to March 30 at 9:00 AM (GMT+8). The event ends after March 30 at 9:00 AM (GMT+8). Keepers, please remember to claim your rewards in \"Round Wonders\""
  },
