  Activity_124987_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = "Hysteria. Call it mania, call it a shattering of the mind; in this era, the diagnosis is a death sentence. Fortunately, the scientists and investigators of Mythag are possessed by a madness of their own: they are determined to conquer this terror."
  },
  Activity_124987_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "The event has ended, and you can currently only participate in \"Ego Dissection.\""
  },
  Activity_124987_ActivityTips = {
    Text = "<Title:Event Overview>\n1. During the event period, Keepers can collect the event currency \"Memory Puzzle\" through limited-time gameplay \"Memory Code,\" \"Manic Accumulation,\" and \"Achievement Rewards\". \"Memory Puzzle\" can be used to purchase items in \"Ego Dissection,\" including the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny \"Silver Cod's Determination,\" Luminous Core, Pure Core, and more. \n2. During the event period, \"Special Ops: Serene Fission\" will be temporarily unlocked for free, and completing event achievements will also grant the event-exclusive avatar \"By the Silver Key: '24'\"!\n\n<Title:Event Time>\n1. February 23, 9:00 - March 9, 9:00 (GMT+8), all event gameplay is available. \n2. March 9, 9:00 - March 16, 9:00 (GMT+8), only \"Ego Dissection\" and Achievement Rewards will be available. \n\n<Title:Memory Code>\n1. \"Memory Code\" consists of 5 stages, with 1 stage automatically unlocking every 2 days. \n2. Each challenge will consume 120 Menophin, and successful challenges will yield event currency. \n3. After clearing a stage, the \"Reenact\" function for that stage will be unlocked. Please note: using the \"Reenact\" function will not grant Affinity. \n4. You can use Alumni Support and \"Resonance: Dissociative Syndrome\" to help you clear stages more easily. \n\n<Title:Rational Bonus>\n1. Keepers with specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be deployed) can receive additional drop bonuses for \"Memory Puzzle\" in the task rewards of \"Memory Code\". The specific bonuses are as follows: \n Awakener \"24\": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%. \n SSR Wheel of Destiny \"Aberrant Devour\": Ascension 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%. \n SR Wheel of Destiny \"Silver Cod's Determination\": Ascension 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%. \n2. Different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny's \"Rational Bonus\" will be calculated in an additive manner. \n3. Notably, the first completion reward for Madness Difficulty challenges will not be affected by the \"Rational Bonus\". \n\n<Title:Resonance: Dissociative Syndrome>\n1. Keepers can obtain \"Heart of Division\" by completing event achievements. \n2. Consuming \"Heart of Division\" to activate \"Resonance: Dissociative Syndrome\" will grant the following bonuses: \n(1) Strengthen Keepers in event gameplay \"Memory Code\" and \"Special Ops: Serene Fission,\" making challenges easier. \n(2) Enhance rewards obtained after completing \"Memory Code\" challenges. \n(3) Activate the event gameplay \"Manic Accumulation\". \n\n<Title: Manic Accumulation>\n1. After activating the resonance \"Diagnosis: Shattered Self,\" you will automatically receive 60 \"Memory Puzzle α\" every hour, with a maximum storage of 25 hours. \n2. After activating the resonance \"Cognitive Sympathy,\" you will automatically receive 30 \"Memory Puzzle β\" every hour, with a maximum storage of 25 hours. \n\n<Title:Special Ops>\n1. During the event period, \"Special Ops: Serene Fission\" can be unlocked for free. \n2. After the event ends, the investigation progress for \"Special Ops: Serene Fission\" will be retained, and completing any unfinished investigation events during the event period will still yield investigation rewards consistent with the event period. If \"Special Ops: Serene Fission\" was not unlocked during the event period, it can still be unlocked after the event by consuming \"Reality Verge\" * 7. \n3. Regardless of whether it was during the event period, clearing \"Special Ops: Serene Fission\" will grant \"Posse: All of Her\". \n\n<Title:Reissue Compensation>\n1. Keepers who have previously unlocked \"Special Ops: Serene Fission\" will receive a compensation of \"Memory Puzzle α\" * 700 when re-unlocking during this reissue event. \n2. Keepers who have previously obtained the event-exclusive avatar \"By the Silver Key: '24'\" will automatically convert the duplicate into \"Formless One's Invitation\" * 1. \n3. Keepers who have previously obtained the activation material \"Heart of Division\" will automatically convert each extra \"Heart of Division\" into \"Rose Scrip\" * 5000. \n"
  },
