  Activity_125364_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = [[
Power, lust, and gilded decadence. Within the mansion's depths, upon the offering table strewn with lifeless bodies, the ancient being slowly opened Her eyes.
Ah, but this is not a terrifying story. She "loves" you, She will "protect" you forever... She intends to bestow all the "very best" upon you.]]
