  Activity_126275_ActivityTips = {
    Text = "<Title:Event Overview>\nDuring the event, Keepers can collect the event currency \"A-Reserve Ticket\" through the limited-time gameplay \"The Puppet's Stage\" and \"Achievement\". \"A-Reserve Ticket\" can be exchanged for rewards at the \"Theater Souvernirs,\" including the exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny \"Rota Fortunae,\" Ethereal Core, Pure Core, Aetheric Shard, Mimetic Crystal, and more.\n\n<Title:The Puppet's Stage>\n1. \"The Puppet's Stage\" contains 5 stages, with 1 stage unlocked every 2 days.\n2. Each challenge costs \"Menophin\" × 120. Successfully completing a challenge rewards cultivation materials and event currency.\n3. After clearing a stage, the \"Reenact\" feature for that stage is unlocked. Please note: Affinity cannot be earned when using the \"Reenact\" feature.\n4. You can use Alumni Support to help you clear stages more easily.\n\n<Title:Event Bonus>\n1. Keepers who own specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be deployed) can earn additional drop bonuses for \"A-Reserve Ticket\" in \"The Puppet's Stage\" stage mission rewards (including Reenact). The specific bonuses are as follows:\n: Awakener \"Arachne\": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%\n: SSR Wheel of Destiny \"Eternal Weave\": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%\n: SR Wheel of Destiny \"Rota Fortunae\": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%\n2. The \"Event Bonus\" from different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny is calculated in a stacking manner.\n3. In particular, the first-clear challenge rewards for Madness Difficulty are not affected by the above bonuses.\n\n<Title: Theater Souvernirs>\n1. Each \"Souvenir Exchange\" costs 750 \"A-Reserve Ticket\" and randomly grants five item rewards from the \"Theater Souvernirs\".\n2. The item rewards in the \"Theater Souvernirs\" are divided into \"Special Items\" and \"Common Items\". A reset can restore the remaining quantity of Special Item rewards to the maximum. The specific rules are as follows:\n(1) First 5 Resets: When \"Special Items\" have no remaining quantity, Keepers may choose to reset, which will reset the remaining quantities of both \"Special Items\" and \"Common Items\" to the limit; or they may choose to continue exchanging. When \"Common Items\" also have no remaining quantity, a reset must be performed to continue exchanging.\n(2) Starting from the 6th Reset: A reset can only be performed when \"Common Items\" have no remaining quantity. The reset will restore the remaining quantity of \"Common Items\" to the limit, while \"Special Items\" will no longer be reset.\n\n<Title:Event Duration>\n1. April 20, 9:00 – May 18, 9:00 (GMT+8): All event gameplay is available.\n2. May 18, 9:00 – May 25, 9:00 (GMT+8): Only \"Theater Souvernirs\" and \"Achievement\" are available.\n3. After May 25, 9:00 (GMT+8): Any remaining unredeemed \"A-Reserve Ticket\" will be converted at a rate of \"Rose Scrip\" × 40 per ticket. Please remember to check your rewards."
  },
