  Activity_126492_ActivityName = {
    Text = "Panlong Soliloquies"
  },
  Activity_126492_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Panlong Soliloquies>
This Archives event comes with 8 gift packs; the first gift pack can be claimed for free.
After purchasing "Panlong Soliloquies," you can immediately claim the 2nd gift pack and unlock packs 3-8 after specific waiting periods.
