  Activity_129488_ActivityName = {
    Text = "Hectic Skybound Rail"
  },
  Activity_129488_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = [[
Frantic commands pierced the lounge, drowning out the train's steady hum.
"Salvador, the third carriage needs backup, please!"
"Wanda, shove your controlled puppets to the rear; they're gaining on us!"
"Ryker! Stop flirting! Come and help me get rid of the creep outside my window!"
In the luxury compartment, you were far too overwhelmed to notice a tiny figure slipping into your pocket.
"Hehe, now this is where it gets interesting."
"Captured some top-tier footage~ Time for little helper 'N' to make an appearance!"]]
  },
  Activity_129488_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
Earn exclusive rewards through "Track Traces" during the event. Once the event ends, these limited-time rewards will no longer be available, so ensure you claim them in time.
Participation grants level compensation for your team: Awakeners below Level 60, Skill Level 5, Madness Omen Level 6, or Soulforge Aptitude Level 5 will be boosted to these minimums. Keepers below Level 60 will also be compensated to Level 60 for the duration of this challenge.

<Title:Special Ops>
During the event, "Special Ops: Spring Festival Express" is free to access.
Your progress is retained after the event ends. If not unlocked during the event period, "Spring Festival Express" can still be accessed later by consuming 7 "Reality Verge."
Clearing "Spring Festival Express" will grant "Posse: Year-End Sparks," regardless of event timing.
<Title:Hectic Skybound Rail>
A permanent challenge based on "Astral Reign" rules. Face various investigation bosses through dynamic, random encounters!
Your relic capacity is expanded, allowing you to hold up to 36 relics simultaneously.
Keepers can now possess and enhance powerful "Resonance" effects from 3 different investigation actions at once.
Every time Emergency Gnosis is used, you will gain 20% less VIP Points this challenge; please plan your tactical strategies with extra caution.
You may exit midway to save your progress, but team stats will not sync with external upgrades. Progress is held for 7 days after your last session; if not resumed within this window, the run will be considered abandoned.

<Title:VIP List>
1. During the event period, the records in the "VIP List" will be retained, and will reset according to the cycle of Mythag Events after the event ends.
2. The "VIP List" will record Keepers who have performed excellently in challenges. Keepers who challenge once during each Mythag Event period and successfully earn "VIP Points" will be entered into the "VIP List."
3. The ranking in the "VIP List" will be based on the maximum "VIP Points" earned in a single challenge and the minimum number of "Turns" used. Re-challenges can be made to improve rankings.

<Title:Event Duration>
1. February 9, 9:00 - March 9, 9:00 (GMT+8), all event content is open for participation.
2. After March 9, 9:00 (GMT+8), the event will be archived in "Arcade," and rewards in "Track Traces" will no longer be claimable.]]
  },
