  Activity_130175_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "The event has Ended. Currently, only \"Dandelion Garden\" is available."
  },
  Activity_130175_ActivityTips = {
    Text = "<Title:Event Overview>\nDuring the event, Keepers can collect event currencies \"Pale Scale Dust\", \"Red Scale Dust\", and \"Shiny Scale Dust\" through the limited-time gameplay \"Dark Chamber Notes\" and \"Achievements\", and exchange them for items in \"Dandelion Garden\", including the event-exclusive SR WoD \"Muddied Fairy Tale\", Luminous Core, Pure Core, and more.\nDuring the event, \"Multiverse Link: Forgotten Seed of Love\" is temporarily unlocked for free. Complete event achievements to also earn the exclusive avatar \"By the Silver Key: Saya\"!\n<Title:Event Duration>\nMay 30, 9:00 - August 24, 9:00 (GMT+8): All event gameplay is available.\nAugust 24, 9:00 - August 31, 9:00 (GMT+8): Only \"Dandelion Garden\" and \"Achievements\" are available.\n<Title:Dark Chamber Notes>\n\"Dark Chamber Notes\" contains 7 stages, with 1 stage automatically unlocked every day.\nEach challenge consumes 120 Menophin. Successfully completing a challenge rewards event currencies.\nAfter clearing a stage, the \"Reenact\" function for that stage is unlocked. Please note: Affinity cannot be obtained when using the \"Reenact\" function.\nYou can use Alumni Support to help you clear stages more easily.\n<Title: Dandelion Garden>\n\"Dandelion Garden\" has three shops, with opening times as follows:\n\"Breeding Garden\": Opens at 9:00 on May 30.\n\"Growing Garden\": Opens at 9:00 on May 31.\n\"Blooming Garden\": Opens at 9:00 on June 1.\nEach exchange will consume 750 \"Pale Scale Dust\"/\"Red Scale Dust\"/\"Shiny Scale Dust\" to randomly obtain five item rewards from \"Dandelion Garden.\"\nThe item rewards in each \"Dandelion Garden\" are divided into two types: \"Special Items\" and \"Common Items.\" During a reset, the remaining quantity of Special Item rewards can be reset to the limit. The specific rules are as follows:\n(1) First 2 Resets: When \"Special Items\" have no remaining quantity, Keepers may choose to reset, which will reset the remaining quantities of both \"Special Items\" and \"Common Items\" to the limit; or they may choose to continue exchanging. When \"Common Items\" also have no remaining quantity, a reset must be performed to continue exchanging.\n(2) Starting from the 3rd Reset: A reset can only be performed when \"Common Items\" have no remaining quantity. The reset will restore the remaining quantity of \"Common Items\" to the limit, while \"Special Items\" will no longer be reset.\n<Title:Event Bonus>\nKeepers who own specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be deployed) can earn additional drop bonuses for all three event currencies in \"Dark Chamber Notes\" stage mission rewards. The specific bonuses are as follows:\nAwakener \"Saya\": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\nSSR Wheel of Destiny \"Fragrant Morphogenesis\": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\nSR Wheel of Destiny \"Muddied Fairy Tale\": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\nMultiple \"Event Bonuses\" can be stacked and calculated together.\nPlease note: First-clear rewards for Madness Difficulty challenges are not affected by the \"Event Bonus\".\n<Title:Multiverse Link>\n1. During the event, \"Multiverse Link: Forgotten Seed of Love\" can be unlocked for free.\n2. After the event ends, investigation progress will be retained. Completing Investigation Events that were not finished during the event will still reward the corresponding rewards. If not unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked after the event ends by consuming \"Reality Verge\" ×3.\nRegardless of whether it is during the event period, clearing \"Multiverse Link: Forgotten Seed of Love\" will reward \"Posse: For the New World\"."
  },
