  },
  Activity_130925_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = "In the ocean's depths, the whirlpool devours all.\nThe demon beneath Moskstraumen gapes its maw—extending an invitation to every living thing that dares draw near.\nDay after day it turns, again and again it howls, calling for the one who shall finally arrive.\nCome. Come. \"Seaweed\" shall embrace you; the \"reefs\" shall accompany you. In the lightless deep, you are fated to dance with calamity—\nand calamity... shall heed your final plea.\nWelcome home, Chosen One. You... never had a choice."
