  Activity_130925_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "The event has ended. Currently, only \"Vortice's Hoard\" is available."
  },
  Activity_130925_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event, Keepers can collect event currencies "Conch One," "Conch Two," and "Conch Three" through the limited-time gameplay "Vortice and the Sea" and "Achievement". "Conch One," "Conch Two," and "Conch Three" can be used to purchase items in "Vortice's Hoard," including the exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "Imprisoned Madness," Luminous Core, Pure Core, and more.
2. During the event, "Psyche Deepdive: No More the Shore" is temporarily unlocked for free. Complete event achievements to also earn the exclusive avatar "By the Silver Key: Vortice"!

<Title:Event Duration>
1. March 9, 9:00 - April 6, 9:00 (GMT+8): All event gameplay is available.
2. April 6, 9:00 - April 13, 9:00 (GMT+8): Only "Vortice's Hoard" and Achievement Rewards are available.

<Title:Vortice and the Sea>
1. "Vortice and the Sea" contains 7 stages, with 1 stage automatically unlocked every day.
2. Each challenge consumes 120 Menophin. Successfully completing a challenge rewards event currencies.
3. After clearing a stage, the "Reenact" function for that stage is unlocked. Please note: Affinity cannot be obtained when using the "Reenact" function.
4. You can use Alumni Support to help you clear stages more easily.

<Title: Vortice's Hoard>
1. "Vortice's Hoard" has three shops, with opening times as follows:
"Treasure One": Opens at 9:00 on March 9.
"Treasure Two": Opens at 9:00 on March 10.
"Treasure Three": Opens at 9:00 on March 11.
2. Each exchange will consume 750 "Conch One"/"Conch Two"/"Conch Three" to randomly obtain five item rewards from "Vortice's Hoard."
3. The item rewards in each "Vortice's Hoard" are divided into two types: "Special Items" and "Common Items." During a reset, the remaining quantity of Special Item rewards can be reset to the limit. The specific rules are as follows:
(1) First 2 Resets: When "Special Items" have no remaining quantity, Keepers may choose to reset, which will reset the remaining quantities of both "Special Items" and "Common Items" to the limit; or they may choose to continue exchanging. When "Common Items" also have no remaining quantity, a reset must be performed to continue exchanging.
(2) Starting from the 3rd Reset: A reset can only be performed when "Common Items" have no remaining quantity. The reset will restore the remaining quantity of "Common Items" to the limit, while "Special Items" will no longer be reset.

<Title:Event Bonus>
1. Keepers who own specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be deployed) can earn additional drop bonuses for "Conch One," "Conch Two," and "Conch Three" in "Vortice's Hoard" stage mission rewards. The specific bonuses are as follows:
Awakener "Vortice": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
SSR Wheel of Destiny "The Faraway Eden": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
SR Wheel of Destiny "Imprisoned Madness": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
2. The "Event Bonus" from different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny is calculated in a stacking manner.
3. In particular, the first-clear rewards for Madness Difficulty challenges are not affected by the "Event Bonus".

<Title:Psyche Deepdive>
1. During the event, "Psyche Deepdive: No More the Shore" can be unlocked for free.
2. After the event ends, the investigation progress of "Psyche Deepdive: No More the Shore" will be retained. Completing Investigation Events that were not finished during the event will still reward the same investigation rewards as during the event. If "Psyche Deepdive: No More the Shore" was not unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked after the event ends by consuming "Reality Verge" *3.
3. Regardless of whether it is during the event period, clearing "Psyche Deepdive: No More the Shore" will reward "Posse: Drowned Innocence".]]
  },
