  Activity_131090_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "Event has Ended. Only \"Wanda's Treasure Vault\" is currently available."
  },
  Activity_131090_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event, Keepers can collect event currencies "Original Tibia," "Tornoceras," and "Spiral Ruins" through the limited-time gameplay "Feast of Flames" and "Achievement Rewards". Event currencies can be used to purchase items in "Wanda's Treasure Vault," including the exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "The Gaze of Isarawu," Luminous Core, Pure Core, and more.
2. During the event, "Psyche Deepdive: Feast of Flames" is temporarily unlocked for free. Complete event achievements to also earn the exclusive avatar "By the Silver Key: Wanda"!

<Title:Event Duration>
1. March 23, 9:00 - April 20, 9:00 (GMT+8): All event gameplay is available.
2. April 20, 9:00 - April 27, 9:00 (GMT+8): Only "Wanda's Treasure Vault" and Achievement Rewards are available.

<Title:City in the Lake>
1. "City in the Lake" has 7 stages, with 1 stage automatically unlocked each day.
2. Each challenge consumes 120 Menophin. Successfully completing a challenge rewards event currencies.
3. After clearing a stage, the "Reenact" function for that stage is unlocked. Please note: Affinity cannot be obtained when using the "Reenact" function.
4. You can use Alumni Support and "Resonance: Secret Order" to help you clear stages more easily.

<Title:Treasure Bonus>
1. Keepers who own specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be deployed) can earn additional drop bonuses for event currencies in "City in the Lake" stage mission rewards. The specific bonuses are as follows:
Awakener "Wanda": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
SSR Wheel of Destiny "Queen's Edict": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
SR Wheel of Destiny "The Gaze of Isarawu": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
2. The "Treasure Bonus" from different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny is calculated in a stacking manner.
3. In particular, the first-clear rewards for Madness Difficulty challenges are not affected by the "Treasure Bonus".

<Title:Resonance: Secret Order>
1. Keepers can obtain "Heart of Hedonism" by completing event achievements.
2. Consuming "Heart of Hedonism" to activate "Resonance: Secret Order" can make Keepers stronger in "City in the Lake," making challenges easier; it can also grant Keepers additional event currencies upon clearing stages.

<Title:Psyche Deepdive>
1. During the event, "Feast of Flames" can be unlocked for free.
2. After the event ends, the investigation progress of "Feast of Flames" will be retained. Completing Investigation Events that were not finished during the event will still reward the same investigation rewards as during the event. If "Feast of Flames" was not unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked after the event ends by consuming "Reality Verge" *3.
3. Regardless of whether it is during the event period, clearing "Feast of Flames" will reward "Posse: Feast of Decay".

<Title:Rerun Compensation>
1. Keepers who have previously unlocked "Psyche Deepdive: Feast of Flames" will receive compensation of "Original Tibia" *300 upon re-unlocking it during this rerun event.
2. Keepers who have previously obtained the exclusive avatar "By the Silver Key: Wanda" will have it automatically converted into 1 "Formless One's Invitation" upon obtaining it again.
3. Keepers who have previously obtained the Resonance activation material "Heart of Hedonism" will have each extra "Heart of Hedonism" automatically converted into "Rose Scrip" *5000.]]
  },
