  Activity_132333_ActivityTips = {
    Text = "<Title:Event Overview>\n1. During the event, Keepers can collect event currency \"Weary Thoughts,\" \"Sad Reflections,\" and \"Joyful Musings\" through the limited-time gameplay \"Gaze of the Deep Sea\" and \"Achievement Rewards.\" Event currencies can be used to purchase items in \"Abyssborn Epiphany,\" including the event-limited SR Wheel of Destiny \"Blue Stone Throne,\" Luminous Core, Pure Core, Aetheric Shard, Mimetic Crystal, and more.\n2. During the event, completing event achievements can also earn you the event-limited avatar \"By the Silver Key: Tulu,\" the event-limited SR Wheel of Destiny \"Blue Stone Throne,\" Silver, and a large amount of event currencies!\n\n<Title:Event Duration>\n1. April 6, 9:00 – May 4, 9:00 (GMT+8): All event gameplay is available.\n2. May 4, 9:00 – May 11, 9:00 (GMT+8): Only \"Abyssborn Epiphany\" and Achievement Rewards are available.\n\n<Title:Gaze of the Deep Sea>\n1. \"Gaze of the Deep Sea\" has 5 stages, with 1 stage automatically unlocked every 2 days.\n2. Each challenge attempt consumes Menophin × 120. Successfully completing a challenge will earn event currencies.\n3. After clearing a stage, the \"Reenact\" feature for that stage will be unlocked. Please note: Affinity cannot be earned when using the \"Reenact\" feature.\n4. You can use alumni Support to help you clear stages more easily.\n\n<Title:Contemplation Bonus>\n1. If a Keeper owns specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be deployed), the event currency drops in \"Gaze of the Deep Sea\" stage mission rewards can receive additional drop bonuses. The specific bonuses are as follows:\n: Awakener \"Tulu\": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\n: SSR Wheel of Destiny \"Hymn of the Sovereign\": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\n: SR Wheel of Destiny \"Blue Stone Throne\": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\n2. The \"Contemplation Bonus\" from different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny is calculated in a stacking manner.\n3. In particular, the first-clear challenge rewards for Madness Difficulty will not be affected by the \"Contemplation Bonus.\"\n\n<Title: Abyssborn Epiphany>\n1. \"Abyssborn Epiphany\" is only available from April 6, 9:00 – May 11, 9:00 (GMT+8).\n2. After May 11, 9:00 (GMT+8), any remaining unredeemed \"Weary Thoughts,\" \"Sad Reflections,\" and \"Joyful Musings\" will be converted at a rate of Rose Scrip × 40 per currency and sent via mail. Please remember to check your inbox.\n\n<Title:Psyche Deepdive>\n1. During the event, \"Psyche Deepdive: Day of Coronation\" can be unlocked for free.\n2. After the event ends, the investigation progress of \"Psyche Deepdive: Day of Coronation\" will be retained. Completing any Investigation Events not finished during the event will still grant the same investigation rewards as during the event. If \"Psyche Deepdive: Day of Coronation\" was not unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked after the event ends by consuming Reality Verge × 3.\n3. Regardless of whether it is during the event period, clearing \"Psyche Deepdive: Day of Coronation\" will reward you with \"Posse: Blessing of the Stars.\"\n\n<Title:Rerun Compensation>\n1. Keepers who have previously unlocked \"Psyche Deepdive: Day of Coronation\" will receive Weary Thoughts × 300 as compensation when unlocking it again during this rerun event.\n2. Keepers who have previously obtained the event-limited avatar \"By the Silver Key: Tulu\" will have it automatically converted to Formless One's Invitation × 1 upon obtaining it again."
  },
