  Activity_133272_ActivityTips = {
    Text = "<Title:Event Overview>\n1. During the event, Keepers can collect the event currency \"Leonian Barbecue\" through the limited-time gameplay \"Divine Predation.\" \"Leonian Barbecue\" can be used in \"Offer Tribute\" to purchase items, including Ethereal Core, Pure Core, and more.\n2. During the event, \"Dreamscape: Culinary Domination\" is temporarily unlocked for free.\n\n<Title:Event Period>\n1. May 4, 9:00 – May 18, 9:00 (GMT+8): All event gameplay is available.\n2. May 18, 9:00 – May 25, 9:00 (GMT+8): Only \"Offer Tribute\" and Achievement Rewards are available.\n\n<Title:Divine Predation>\n1. \"Divine Predation\" contains 5 stages, with 1 stage automatically unlocked every 2 days.\n2. Each challenge consumes Menophin × 120, and successfully completing a challenge rewards event currency.\n3. After clearing a stage, the \"Reenact\" feature for that stage will be unlocked. Please note: Affinity cannot be earned when using the \"Reenact\" feature.\n4. You can use Alumni Support to help you clear stages more easily.\n\n<Title: Offer Tribute>\nIn the \"Offer Tribute\" shop, you can use the event currency \"Leonian Barbecue\" to select and directly purchase items.\n\n<Title:Dreamscape>\n1. During the event, \"Dreamscape: Culinary Domination\" can be unlocked for free.\n2. After the event ends, the investigation progress of \"Dreamscape: Culinary Domination\" will be retained. Completing any Investigation Events left unfinished during the event will still reward the same investigation rewards as during the event. If \"Dreamscape: Culinary Domination\" was not unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked after the event ends by consuming \"Reality Verge\" × 7.\n3. Regardless of whether it is during the event period, clearing \"Dreamscape: Culinary Domination\" will reward \"Posse: Voracious Resolve.\""
