  Activity_139591_ActivityName = {
    Text = "Meowch Obliged!"
  },
  Activity_139591_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = "\"Emergency notice: All faculty and students, please cease your current tasks immediately and assist in capturing the escaped test subjects.\"\n\"Repeat: All faculty and students, please cease your current tasks immediately and assist in capturing the escaped—Damn it! The cats got in!\"\n\nBy the time you heard the panicked voice over the broadcast, the entire campus had already been engulfed in black fur, and everyone was flustered trying to catch these little troublemakers that escaped from the lab.\nAs if seeking revenge for Spring Festival, these black cats were slowly and methodically converging on your dormitory.\n\nBut then again... considering the large amount of Rose Scrip and Silver they're carrying, it's hard to say whether they're here for revenge or to return the favor.\nBe careful not to over-catch them, though."
  },
  Activity_139591_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "The event has ended."
  },
  Activity_139591_ActivityTips = {
    Text = "<Title: Meowch Obliged!>\nMeowch Obliged! features 7 unique, non-repeatable stages that must be challenged directly. One new stage unlocks each day.\nDefeating the corresponding \"Dimensional Black Cat\" in each challenge contributes to event progress. Rewards can be claimed through the \"Cat Capture Log\".\nEach \"Dimensional Black Cat\" has numerous duplicates—challenges can be attempted unlimited times throughout the event and support auto-battle.\nEach stage provides different Relics that grant powerful bonuses.\nAll stages require a Support Keeper. Throughout the event, each mutually-followed Keeper may only provide support to you once.\n\n\n<Title: Level Compensation>\nMeowch Obliged! includes a level compensation system so all Keepers can fight side by side!\nCompensation rules are as follows:\nAwakeners in your team below level 60 will be compensated to level 60 for the duration of the challenge.\nAwakeners in your team with skill levels below 5 will be compensated to skill level 5 for the duration of the challenge.\nAwakeners in your team with Madness Omen below level 6 will be compensated to level 6 for the duration of the challenge.\nAwakeners in your team with Soulforge Aptitude below level 5 will be compensated to level 5 for the duration of the challenge.\nKeepers below level 60 will be compensated to level 60 for the duration of the challenge.\n\n<Title: Black Cat Capture Log>\nDuring the event, defeating the corresponding \"Dimensional Black Cat\" accumulates quest progress, allowing Keepers to claim rewards through the \"Cat Capture Log\". The Log is divided into two sections: \"Personal Capture Log\" and \"Campus Capture Log\". The \"Personal Capture Log\" tracks each Keeper's individual progress. The \"Campus Capture Log\" tracks the combined progress of all Keepers campus-wide.\n\n<Title: Capture Rankings>\nDuring the event, Keepers can view the \"Keeper Ranking\" and the \"Support Ranking\" under \"Capture Rankings\".\n\n<Title: Event Duration>\nKeepers may access the event page and join the challenge before 9:00 AM, June 15 (GMT+8). No new Keepers will be admitted after this time. Keepers who have already joined may continue participating if the event has not yet concluded.\nIf the \"Total Capture Count\" is reached before 9:00 AM, June 15 (GMT+8), the event will end on June 29 at 9:00 AM (GMT+8). If the \"Total Capture Count\" is not reached by that time, the event will end 14 days after the \"Total Capture Count\" is achieved."
  },
