  Activity_139923_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "Event has Ended. Only \"Somnus Citadel\" is currently available."
  },
  Activity_139923_ActivityTips = {
    Text = "<Title:Event Introduction>\n1. During the event, Keepers can collect the event currency \"Aria's Peak\" through the limited-time gameplay \"Roaring Machines\" and \"Achievements.\" \"Aria's Peak\" can be exchanged for generous rewards in \"Somnus Citadel,\" including the event-limited SR Wheel of Destiny \"Never-Ending Performance,\" \"Pure Core,\" \"Luminous Core,\" \"Aetheric Shard,\" \"Mimetic Crystal,\" and more.\n2. During the event, completing \"Achievements\" missions will grant the event-limited avatar \"In the Name of the Silver Key: Hameln,\" the event-limited SR Wheel of Destiny \"Never-Ending Performance,\" Silver, and a large amount of event currency \"Aria's Peak.\"\n\n<Title:Event Duration>\n1. June 15, 9:00 - July 13, 9:00 (GMT+8): All event content is available.\n2. July 13, 9:00 - July 20, 9:00 (GMT+8): Only \"Somnus Citadel\" and \"Achievements\" will remain available. All other content will have ended and cannot be accessed.\n\n<Title: Roaring Machines>\n1. \"Roaring Machines\" contains 9 stages, with 1 automatically opening each day.\n2. Each challenge attempt costs Menophin × 120. Challenging different stages will yield different material drops as well as the event currency \"Aria's Peak.\"\n3. This event's stages are direct-combat material stages. After clearing them, they can be replayed! Each replay costs Menophin × 120.\n4. Please note: When using the replay function, Affinity cannot be obtained.\n\n<Title: Aria Bonus>\n1. Keepers who own specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (deployment not required) can receive bonus drops of \"Aria's Peak\" from \"Roaring Machines\" stage mission rewards (including replays). The specific bonuses are as follows:\n·Awakener \"Hameln\": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%\n·SSR Wheel of Destiny \"Eternal Requiem\": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%\n·SR Wheel of Destiny \"Never-Ending Performance\": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%\n2. \"Aria Bonus\" from different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny is calculated additively.\n3. Specifically, Madness Difficulty first-clear challenge rewards are not affected by \"Aria Bonus.\"\n\n<Title: Somnus Citadel>\n1. \"Somnus Citadel\" is only open from June 15, 9:00 - July 13, 9:00 (GMT+8).\n2. After July 20, 9:00 (GMT+8), remaining unexchanged \"Aria's Peak\" will be converted at a rate of Rose Scrip × 40 per unit. Please check your mail."
  },
