  Activity_140082_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "Event has Ended. Only \"A Hidden Base\" is currently available."
  },
  Activity_140082_ActivityTips = {
    Text = "<Title:Event Overview>\n1. During the event, Keepers can collect event currencies \"Seal\" of Wealth, \"Seal\" of Death, and \"Seal\" of War through the limited-time gameplay \"Hunt of the Charred\", \"The Quiet Campfire\", and Achievements. \"Seal\" of Wealth, \"Seal\" of Death, and \"Seal\" of War can be used to purchase items in \"A Hidden Base\", including the event-limited SR Wheel of Destiny \"Impending Sun\", Luminous Core, Pure Core, and more.\n2. During the event, \"Everburning Vex\" will be unlocked for free for a limited time. Complete event achievements to also obtain the event-limited avatar \"By the Silver Key: Kathigu-Ra\"!\n\n<Title:Event Duration>\n1,September 7, 9:00 - October 5, 9:00 (GMT+8), all event gameplay is available.\n2,October 5, 9:00 - October 12, 9:00 (GMT+8), only \"A Hidden Base\" and Achievement Rewards are available.\n\n<Title:Hunt of the Charred>\n1. \"Hunt of the Charred\" contains 7 stages, with 1 stage automatically unlocked every 1 day.\n2. Each challenge will consume \"Menophin\" × 120, and a successful challenge will reward event currency.\n3. After clearing a stage, the \"Reenact\" feature for that stage is unlocked. Please note: Affinity cannot be obtained when using the \"Reenact\" feature.\n4. You can use Alumni Support to help you clear stages more easily.\n\n<Title: A Hidden Base>\n\"A Hidden Base\" has three shops, with opening times as follows:\n·\"Treasure Vault\": Opens at 9:00 on September 7.\n·\"Commission Room\": Opens at 9:00 on September 8.\n·\"War Camp\": Opens at 9:00 on September 9.\nYou can select items in the shop to purchase directly.\n\n<Title:Event Bonus>\n1. If a Keeper possesses specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be deployed), the \"Seal\" of Wealth, \"Seal\" of Death, and \"Seal\" of War in \"Hunt of the Charred\" stage mission rewards can receive additional drop bonuses. The specific bonuses are as follows:\n·Awakener \"Kathigu-Ra\": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\n·SSR Wheel of Destiny \"Amber-Tinted Death\": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\n·SR Wheel of Destiny \"Impending Sun\": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\n2. The \"Event Bonus\" from different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny is calculated in a stacking manner.\n3. In particular, the first-clear challenge rewards for Madness Difficulty will not be affected by the \"Event Bonus\".\n\n<Title: The Quiet Campfire>\n1,Automatically obtain 60 \"Seal\" of Wealth per hour, with a maximum storage of 25 hours.\n\n<Title:Psyche Deepdive>\n1. During the event, \"Everburning Vex\" can be unlocked for free.\n2. After the event ends, the investigation progress of \"Everburning Vex\" will be retained. Investigation rewards consistent with those during the event can still be obtained after completing investigation events that were not finished during the event. If \"Everburning Vex\" was not unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked after the event ends by consuming \"Reality Verge\" × 3.\n3. Regardless of whether it is during the event period, clearing \"Psyche Deepdive: Everburning Vex\" will reward you with \"Posse: Undying Sun\"."
  },
