    Text = "Mirrored Prisoner: Rerun"
  },
  Activity_141467_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = [[
Bird, oh bird, why do broken shackles still cling to your feet?
Bird, oh bird, why do you sing alone in the vast, empty sky?
You tore free from thorns, fled the cage, your wings spanning the endless desert, yet your mournful song never fades.
Who is the loyal companion you long for? Where lies the true home you seek?]]
  },
  Activity_141467_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "Event has ended. Currently, only \"Thirst for Knowledge\" can be participated in."
  },
  Activity_141467_ActivityTips = {
    Text = "<Title:Event Overview>\n1,During the event, Keepers can collect event currencies \"Common Sense Textbook\", \"Mathematics Textbook\", and \"Literature Textbook\" through the limited-time gameplay \"Beyond the Skies\", \"Oneiric Cruise\", and Achievement Rewards. \"Common Sense Textbook\", \"Mathematics Textbook\", and \"Literature Textbook\" can be used to purchase items in \"Thirst for Knowledge\", including the event-limited SR Wheel of Destiny \"Lone Feather\", Luminous Core, Pure Core, and more.\n2,During the event, \"Dreamscape: Beyond the Skies: Part I\" will be unlocked for free for a limited time. Complete event achievements to also obtain the event-limited avatar \"By the Silver Key: Castor\"!\n\n<Title:Event Duration>\n1,October 5, 9:00 - November 2, 9:00 (GMT+8), all event gameplay is available.\n2,November 2, 9:00 - November 9, 9:00 (GMT+8), only \"Thirst for Knowledge\" and Achievement Rewards are available.\n\n<Title:Beyond the Skies>\n1,\"Beyond the Skies\" contains 7 stages, with 1 stage automatically unlocked every 1 day.\n2,Each challenge will consume \"Menophin\" × 120, and a successful challenge will reward event currency.\n3,After clearing a stage, the \"Reenact\" feature for that stage is unlocked. Please note: Affinity cannot be obtained when using the \"Reenact\" feature.\n4,You can use Alumni Association Support to help you clear stages more easily.\n\n<Title: Thirst for Knowledge>\n\"Thirst for Knowledge\" has three shops, with opening times as follows:\n·\"General Elective\": Opens at 9:00 on October 5.\n·\"Science Elective\": Opens at 9:00 on October 6.\n·\"Literature Elective\": Opens at 9:00 on October 7.\nYou can select items in the shop to purchase directly.\n\n<Title:Event Bonus>\n1,If a Keeper possesses specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be deployed), the \"Common Sense Textbook\", \"Mathematics Textbook\", and \"Literature Textbook\" in \"Beyond the Skies\" stage mission rewards can receive additional drop bonuses. The specific bonuses are as follows:\n·Awakener \"Castor\": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\n·SSR Wheel of Destiny \"Unbearable Freedom\": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\n·SR Wheel of Destiny \"Lone Feather\": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\n2,The \"Event Bonus\" from different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny is calculated in a stacking manner.\n3,In particular, the first-clear challenge rewards for Madness Difficulty will not be affected by the \"Event Bonus\".\n\n<Title: Oneiric Cruise>\n1,Automatically obtain 60 \"Common Sense Textbook\" per hour, with a maximum storage of 25 hours.\n\n<Title:Dreamscape>\n1,During the event, \"Dreamscape: Beyond the Skies: Part I\" can be unlocked for free.\n2,After the event ends, the investigation progress of \"Dreamscape: Beyond the Skies: Part I\" will be retained. Investigation rewards consistent with those during the event can still be obtained after completing investigation events that were not finished during the event. If \"Dreamscape: Beyond the Skies: Part I\" was not unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked after the event ends by consuming \"Reality Verge\" × 7.\n3,Regardless of whether it is during the event period, clearing \"Dreamscape: Beyond the Skies: Part I\" will reward you with \"Posse: Derision of Destiny\"."
  },
