  Activity_141533_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = [[
Let our laughter swell; let our revelry brave the endless night. May our talons pierce our enemies' throats, and leave the humdrum days to rot in the abyss. 
Age, banality, and solitude shall claim us no more. 
Stay. Stay in Ebwynnos. Here we are happy forever, here we are together forever. 
Nothing will part us again.]]
