  Activity_141533_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "Event has Ended. Currently only \"Hunting Grounds\" is available."
  },
  Activity_141533_ActivityTips = {
    Text = "<Title:Event Overview>\n\n1.During the event, Keepers can collect event currencies Fresh \"Prey\", Colossal \"Prey\", and Primordial \"Prey\" through the limited-time gameplay \"The High House Hunt\" and \"Achievements\", and exchange them for items in \"Hunting Grounds\", including the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny \"Compass to False North\", Luminous Core, Pure Core, and more.\n\n2.During the event, \"Psyche Deepdive: Ebwynnos Evermore\" is temporarily unlocked for free. Complete event achievements to also earn the event-exclusive avatar \"By the Silver Key: Pontos\"!\n\n\n<Title:Event Duration>\n\n1.June 29, 9:00 - July 27, 9:00 (GMT+8): All event gameplay is available.\n\n2.July 27, 9:00 - August 3, 9:00 (GMT+8): Only \"Hunting Grounds\" and Achievements are available.\n\n\n<Title:The High House Hunt>\n\n1.\"The High House Hunt\" contains 7 stages, with 1 stage automatically unlocked each day.\n\n2.Each challenge consumes Menophin ×120. Successfully completing a challenge rewards event currencies.\n\n3.After clearing a stage, the \"Reenact\" function for that stage is unlocked. Please note: Affinity cannot be obtained when using the \"Reenact\" function.\n\n4.You can use Alumni Support to help you clear stages more easily.\n\n\n<Title:Hunting Grounds>\n\n\"Hunting Grounds\" has three shops, with opening times as follows:\n\n\"Cold Iron\": Opens at 9:00 on June 29.\n\n\"Fire and Sulfur\": Opens at 9:00 on June 30.\n\n\"Sorcery\": Opens at 9:00 on July 1.\nItems in each shop can be directly purchased.\n\n\n<Title:Event Bonus>\n\n1.Keepers who own specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be deployed) can earn additional drop bonuses for all three event currencies in \"The High House Hunt\" stage mission rewards. The specific bonuses are as follows:\n\nAwakener \"Pontos\": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\n\nSSR Wheel of Destiny \"The Living Cage\": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\n\nSR Wheel of Destiny \"Compass to False North\": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\n2.The \"Event Bonus\" from different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny is calculated in a stacking manner.\n\n3.In particular, the first-clear rewards for Madness Difficulty challenges are not affected by the \"Event Bonus\".\n\n<Title:Psyche Deepdive>\n\n1.During the event, \"Psyche Deepdive: Ebwynnos Evermore\" can be unlocked for free.\n2.After the event ends, investigation progress will be retained. Investigation Events not completed during the event can still be completed afterward for the same corresponding rewards. If not unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked after the event ends by consuming Reality Verge ×3.\n3.Regardless of whether it is during the event period, clearing \"Psyche Deepdive: Ebwynnos Evermore\" will reward \"Posse: The Hollow One\"."
  },
