  Activity_145458_ActivityName = {
    Text = "Leviathan's Game"
  },
  Activity_145458_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = "Greedy heroes crave immortal thrones, desperate mothers seek resurrected children, and mad warlocks hunger for forbidden knowledge—they kneel before It, pleading with the same words It has heard for over ten thousand years.\nIt grants them everything, only to watch them lose it all. It has witnessed four thousand brutal contests, yet remains insatiable.\nThis time, the gates of the arena open for you. Come, tell It—what is it you desire?\nTell It how you differ from those four thousand fallen souls."
  },
  Activity_145458_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "The event has ended. Only the \"Arena Sacrificial Altar\" is currently available."
  },
  Activity_145458_ActivityTips = {
    Text = "<Title:Event Overview>\nDuring the event, Keepers can collect the event currency \"Crimson Sacrifice\" through the limited-time gameplay \"Greed and Bloodlust\" and \"Achievements\". \"Crimson Sacrifice\" can be exchanged for rewards at the \"Arena Altar\", including the exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny \"Undying Hungerbone\", Luminous Core, Pure Core, Aetheric Shard, Mimetic Crystal, and more.\n\n<Title:Greed and Bloodlust>\n1. \"Greed and Bloodlust\" contains 5 stages, with 1 stage automatically unlocked every 2 days.\n2. Each challenge consumes 120 Menophin. Successfully completing a challenge rewards the event currency \"Crimson Sacrifice\".\n3. After clearing a stage, the \"Reenact\" function for that stage is unlocked. Please note: Affinity cannot be obtained when using the \"Reenact\" function.\n4. You can use Alumni Support to help you clear stages more easily.\n\n<Title:Event Bonus>\n1. Keepers who own specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be deployed) can earn additional drop bonuses for \"Crimson Sacrifice\" in \"Greed and Bloodlust\" stage mission rewards (including Reenact). The specific bonuses are as follows:\nAwakener \"Lotan: Cetarchon\": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\nSSR Wheel of Destiny \"Cetus Occasus\": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\nSR Wheel of Destiny \"Undying Hungerbone\": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\n2. \"Event Bonuses\" from different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny are calculated cumulatively.\n3. In particular, the first-clear rewards for Madness Difficulty challenges are not affected by the above bonuses.\n\n<Title:Psyche Deepdive>\n1. During the event, \"Psyche Deepdive: Till the Cetus Falls\" can be unlocked for free.\n2. After the event ends, the investigation progress of \"Psyche Deepdive: Till the Cetus Falls\" will be retained. Completing Investigation Events that were not finished during the event will still reward the same investigation rewards as during the event. If \"Psyche Deepdive: Till the Cetus Falls\" was not unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked after the event ends by consuming \"Reality Verge\" ×3.\n3. Regardless of whether it is during the event period, clearing \"Psyche Deepdive: Till the Cetus Falls\" will reward \"Posse: Cetus-Devouring Storm\".\n\n<Title:Event Duration>\n1. July 27, 9:00 - August 24, 9:00 (GMT+8): All content in the Event Overview is available.\n2. August 24, 9:00 - August 31, 9:00 (GMT+8): Only \"Arena Altar\" and \"Achievement Rewards\" remain available; all other content has ended and is no longer accessible.\n3. After August 31, 9:00 (GMT+8), any remaining unexchanged \"Crimson Sacrifice\" will be converted at a rate of 40 Rose Scrip per unit. Please check your mail, Keepers."
  },
