  Activity_145465_ActivityName = {
    Text = "If Life Was As Usual: Rerun"
  },
  Activity_145465_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = [[
Have you ever imagined what everyone's life would be like if disaster had never struck?
Your power to save the world has no place to be used, and every day you hustle for a mundane campus life and to earn a pitiful amount of credits. The playground is no longer filled with the figures training for battle; instead, there are rows of canvas tents for club activities, along with the sounds of recruitment and playful shouts. When the school bell rings, hungry students immediately fill the cafeteria...
If you knock on the doors of those you care about, what kind of smiling faces will you see?]]
  },
  Activity_145465_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "The event has ended. Only the \"Student Union Building\" is currently available."
  },
  Activity_145465_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event, you can collect the event currency "Seaside Shells" through the limited-time gameplay "New Thing Under the Sun." You can use the "Seaside Shells" to purchase items in the "Student Union Building," including Luminous Core, Pure Core, Aetheric Shard, and more.
2. During the event, "Dreamscape: See You, Neverland" will be available for limited free access!

<Title:Event Duration>
1. August 3rd, 9:00 AM - August 17th, 9:00 AM (GMT+8): all event gameplay is available.
2. August 17th, 9:00 AM - August 24th, 9:00 AM (GMT+8): you can only participate in the "Student Union Building" and claim Achievement Rewards.

<Title:New Thing Under the Sun>
1. "New Thing Under the Sun" consists of 5 levels, with one automatically opening every 2 days.
2. Each challenge will consume 120 Menophin, and successful challenges will yield event currency for you.
3. After you complete a level, the "Reenact" feature for that level will be unlocked. Note: When you use the "Reenact" feature, you cannot obtain Affinity.
4. You can enlist the help of Alumnis to make it easier to pass the levels.<Title:Student Union Building>
The "Student Union Building" has a store that opens on August 3rd at 9:00 AM.
In the store, you can select items for direct purchase.

<Title:Dreamscape>
1. During the event, you can unlock "Dreamscape: See You, Neverland" for free.
2. After the event ends, your investigation progress for "Dreamscape: See You, Neverland" will be retained. Completing any unfinished investigation events from the event period will still yield investigation rewards consistent with the event period for you. If you did not unlock "Dreamscape: See You, Neverland" during the event, you can still unlock it after the event by consuming "Reality Verge" *7.
3. Regardless of whether it is during the event, completing "Dreamscape: See You, Neverland" will grant you "Posse: A Fleeting Dream."]]
  },
