  Activity_145717_ActivityName = {
    Text = "New Moon and Deep Snow"
  },
  Activity_145717_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = "The sevenfold rite of worship, the threefold sacred oath—carry a devout faith in the pure white fairy and climb to where sky and snow meet, and she will grant your every wish. Every last one. Every soul has its purpose, and beneath every purpose lies its own lie. Dig Them up. Bring Them to light... before you surrender to the flawless surface of of her narrative. Do not sink into this deep snow at her side."
  },
  Activity_145717_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "The event has ended. Currently, only \"Fairy's Rituals\" is available."
  },
  Activity_145717_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event, Keepers can collect the event currencies "Crimson Apple", "Golden Apple", and "Candy Apple" through the limited-time gameplay "Umapati's Treasures" and "Achievements", and exchange them for goods at the "Fairy Ceremony", including the exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "Serene Truth", Luminous Core, Pure Core, and more.
2. Completing event achievements during the event can also reward the exclusive avatar "By the Silver Key: Caraboo"!

<Title:Event Duration>
1. August 24, 9:00 - September 21, 9:00 (GMT+8): All event gameplay is available.
2. September 21, 9:00 - September 28, 9:00 (GMT+8): Only "Fairy's Rituals" and achievement rewards are available.
<Title:Umapati's Treasures>
1. "Umapati's Treasures" contains 7 stages, with 1 stage automatically unlocked each day.
2. Each challenge consumes 120 Menophin. Successfully completing a challenge rewards event currency.
3. After clearing a stage, the "Reenact" function for that stage is unlocked. Please note: Affinity cannot be obtained when using the "Reenact" function.
4. You can use Alumni Support to help you clear stages more easily.

<Title: Fairy's Rituals>
1. "Fairy's Rituals" has three shops, with opening times as follows:
"Blessing of Snow": Opens at 9:00 on August 24.
"Blessing of Frost": Opens at 9:00 on August 25.
"Blessing of White": Opens at 9:00 on August 26.
2. Each "Receive Blessings" will consume 750 "Crimson Apple"/"Golden Apple"/"Candy Apple" to randomly obtain five item rewards from "Fairy's Rituals."
3. The item rewards in each "Fairy's Rituals" are divided into two types: "Special Items" and "Common Items." During a reset, the remaining quantity of Special Item rewards can be reset to the limit. The specific rules are as follows:
(1) First 2 Resets: When "Special Items" have no remaining quantity, Keepers may choose to reset, which will reset the remaining quantities of both "Special Items" and "Common Items" to the limit; or they may choose to continue exchanging. When "Common Items" also have no remaining quantity, a reset must be performed to continue exchanging.
(2) Starting from the 3rd Reset: A reset can only be performed when "Common Items" have no remaining quantity. The reset will restore the remaining quantity of "Common Items" to the limit, while "Special Items" will no longer be reset.

<Title:Event Bonus>
1. Keepers who own specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be deployed) can earn additional drop bonuses for all three event currencies in "Umapati's Treasures" stage mission rewards:
Awakener "Caraboo": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
SSR Wheel of Destiny "Honeyed Deceit": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
SR Wheel of Destiny "Serene Truth": Ascension 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
2. Multiple "Event Bonuses" can be stacked and calculated together.
3. Please note: First-clear rewards for Madness Difficulty challenges are not affected by the "Event Bonus".]]
  },
