  Activity_15793_ActivityName = {
    Text = "Phantom of the Rain"
  },
  Activity_15793_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = [[
Every rainy night is accompanied by disappointment and loneliness.
Some lose love, some lose dignity.
And some lose their heads.]]
  },
  Activity_15793_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Participation Conditions>
Complete "Investigation Operation" 2-9 (Normal) to participate.
<Title:Investigation Event>
During the event period, a new investigation event in "Shadows of Rain Town" will be launched daily. Keepers can unlock and investigate without consuming inventory. After completing the investigation event, rewards such as Pure Core, Investigation Badge, and Keeper EXP can be obtained.
After the event ends, the investigation progress of "Shadows of Rain Town" will be retained. Keepers can consume D-Jewels in the Special Ops to unlock uncompleted investigations. Completing uncompleted investigation events during the event period will also grant rewards consistent with those during the event.<Title:Limited Time Rewards>
Limited time rewards will be available during the event. Keepers can obtain Pure Core, Philosopher's Stone, and Silver after clearing "Shadows of Rain Town" (Normal mode) and completing investigation events of "Shadows of Rain Town"! Limited time rewards are only available during the event period and cannot be completed or claimed after the event ends.]]
  },
  Activity_15793_UnlockConditionExplanation = {
    Text = "Unlocks after completing Main Story 2-9: Normal"
  },
