  Activity_23693_ActivityName = {
    Text = "Pale Descendant"
  },
  Activity_23693_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = "Legend has it that beneath Londinium, there is a single Gate.\nIt leads to the domain of the Ashen Mistress…"
  },
  Activity_23693_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Participation Conditions>
Participation is available after completing the normal mode of the consciousness wandering "The Knight's Wish".
<Title:Investigation Events>
During the event period, a new investigation event will be launched daily in "Pale Descendant". Keepers can unlock and conduct investigations without consuming any inventory, and completing investigation events will yield rewards such as pure cores, investigation badges, and Keeper's experience.
After the event ends, the investigation progress in "Pale Descendant" will be preserved. Keepers can unlock any locked investigations in the consciousness wandering by consuming D-jewels, and completing any unfinished investigation events during the event period will also yield investigation rewards consistent with those available during the event.<Title:Limited-Time Rewards>
Limited-time rewards will be available during the event period. Keepers can receive the Dark Lock and Silver rewards after completing the normal mode of "Pale Descendant" and finishing its investigation events! Limited-time rewards are only available during the event, and cannot be completed or claimed after it ends.]]
  },
