Limited time rewards will be available during the event. Keepers can obtain Pure Core, Philosopher's Stone, and Silver after clearing "Tribute to the Rose" (Normal) mode and completing investigation events of "Tribute to the Rose"! Limited time rewards are only available during the event period and cannot be completed or claimed after the event ends.]]
