  Activity_34754_ActivityName = {
    Text = "The Magic of Storytelling"
  },
  Activity_34754_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Participation Conditions>
Complete "Investigation Operation" 2-9 (Normal) to participate.
<Title:Investigation Event>
During the event period, a new investigation event from "Magic of Stories" will be launched daily. Keepers can unlock and investigate without consuming inventory. After completing the investigation event, rewards such as Pure Core, Investigation Badge, and Keeper EXP can be obtained.
After the event ends, the investigation progress of "Magic of Stories" will be retained. Keepers can consume D-Jewels in Special Ops to unlock uncompleted investigations. Completing uncompleted investigation events during the event period will also grant rewards consistent with those during the event.<Title:Limited Time Rewards>
Limited time rewards will be available during the event. Keepers can obtain Pure Core, Philosopher's Stone, and Silver after clearing "Magic of Stories" (Normal mode) and completing investigation events of "Magic of Stories"! Limited time rewards are only available during the event period and cannot be completed or claimed after the event ends.]]
  },
  Activity_34755_ActivityName = {
    Text = "The Magic of Storytelling"
  },
  Activity_34755_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
During the event, the "Plotted Mystery" gameplay will be available for a limited time, and "Special Ops Record: The Magic of Stories" will be unlocked for free!

<Title:Plotted Mystery>
"Plotted Mystery" contains 9 difficulty levels, recommended for levels 30 to 70. Higher difficulty levels are unlocked after completing lower ones.
Each challenge requires consuming Menophin *60, and completing each stage will earn you the event currency "Drifting Inspiration". The higher the difficulty, the more "Drifting Inspiration" you can earn!
"Drifting Inspiration" can be exchanged for a large amount of Awakener training materials at the "Arcane Codex Emporium," and can also be exchanged for the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "35mm Magic," which may be re-released or included in permanent awakenings in the future.
During each challenge, besides the boss, enemies, events, and maps may vary, and more Relics may appear in the levels!
You can use Alumnis assistance in "Plotted Mystery".

<Title:Resonance and Achievements>
By consuming "Heart of Deduction" and activating "Resonance: Director Password," Keepers can become stronger in "Plotted Mystery," making challenges easier.
Keepers can attain "Heart of Deduction" by achieving Event accomplishments, and in addition, they can also receive the event-exclusive avatar "By the Silver Key: Lily" through these achievements!

<Title:Special Ops Record>
During the event, a new Investigation event from "The Magic of Stories" will be released daily, and Keepers can unlock Investigations without consuming resources; upon completing the Investigation event, rewards such as Pure Core, Investigation Badges, and Keeper EXP will be obtained.
After the event ends, the Investigation progress of "The Magic of Stories" will be retained, and Keepers can use D-Jewel to unlock Investigations that were not yet completed. Completing Investigations that were unfinished during the event will still yield the same rewards as during the event.
Limited-time Achievement rewards will be released during the event. Keepers can receive Silver rewards in the Event Achievements after completing the regular mode of "The Magic of Stories" and the Investigation events! Achievement rewards will only be available during the event; they cannot be completed or claimed after the event ends.
]]
  },
