  Activity_38805_ActivityName = {
    Text = "Feast of Flames"
  },
  Activity_38805_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = [[
Isarawu, City in the Lake, is said to be the homeland of Wanda.
This time you will pass through the Gate of Dreams and arrive at the ancient towers filled with clock tongues...]]
  },
  Activity_38805_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
During the event, the "Feast of Flames" gameplay is available for a limited time, and "Psyche Deepdive: Feast of Flames" is unlocked for free!

<Title:City in the Lake>
"City in the Lake" contains 7 stages, with 1 stage opening every 2 days! The enemies and events in each stage may randomly change.
Please note, the type, quantity, and mixture ratio of stage reward materials may vary. Earlier opened stages have simpler material types, while later stages have more diverse types and larger total amounts. Please choose your strategy accordingly!
Each stage includes 7 difficulty levels, with recommended levels ranging from 15~65. All difficulties are unlocked by default.
Each challenge consumes 120 Menophin. Higher difficulties offer better rewards, so choose the difficulty that suits you best.
The materials earned in stages can be exchanged in "Wanda's Treasure Vault" for a large amount of Awakener cultivation materials, as well as the event-exclusive avatar "By the Silver Key: Wanda".
You may use Alumnis assistance and "Resonance: Secret Order" to help you pass stages more easily.

<Title:Resonance and Achievements>
Consuming "Heart of Hedonism" to activate "Resonance: Secret Order" can make the Keeper stronger in "City in the Lake" and make challenges easier; it can also grant additional event currency upon completing stages.
Keepers can obtain "Heart of Hedonism" by completing event achievements or exchange them in "Wanda's Treasure Vault".

<Title:Psyche Deepdive>
During the event, "Feast of Flames" can be unlocked for free. Each day, a new investigation event from "Feast of Flames" will be released, and completing these events grants rewards such as Pure Core, Investigation Badge, and Keeper EXP.
After the event ends, investigation progress in "Feast of Flames" will be retained. Completing unfinished investigation events after the event will still grant the same rewards as during the event. If "Feast of Flames" was not unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked after the event by consuming 3 "Reality Verge".
During the event, limited-time achievement rewards will be available. Keepers who complete investigation events in "Feast of Flames" can claim Silver rewards in the Event Achievements! Achievement rewards are only available during the event and cannot be completed or claimed afterward.
]]
  },
