  Activity_44273_ActivityName = {
    Text = "Soul Shepherd"
  },
  Activity_44273_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = [[
He suffered for you and bore your calamities.
Through the Caro He sacrificed, you were healed;
Through the life He gave, you were forgiven.]]
  },
  Activity_44273_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event, Keepers can collect event currency "Charity Vouchers" through limited-time activities "Path of the Church," "Civic Kindness," and "Achievement Rewards". "Charity Vouchers" can be exchanged for random items at the "Church Charity Sale," including the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "Man in the Mirror," Pure Core, Lumen Core, and more.
2. Complete "Special Record: Color of Blood" to obtain the new Posse "Miracle Arrival". During the event, "Special Record: Color of Blood" has limited free access, and completing event achievements will also reward you with the event-exclusive avatar "By the Silver Key: Salvador"!

<Title:Path of the Church>
1. "Path of the Church" consists of 5 stages, which Keepers can unlock one by one by completing stages 2/4/6/7/9 of "Special Record: Color of Blood".
2. Each stage has 7 difficulty levels, recommended for levels 15-65, and all difficulties are unlocked by default. Enemies and events in each stage may vary randomly.
3. You can use Alumni assistance and "Resonance: Soul's Fork" to make passing the stages easier.
4. Each challenge consumes 120 Menophin, with higher difficulty yielding more "Charity Vouchers". Keepers can choose Double Challenge, consuming 240 Menophin for double "Charity Vouchers" and Keeper's Experience.

<Title:Glimmer Bonus>
1. Under the influence of "Soul's Glimmer," Awakener "Salvador," SSR Wheel of Destiny "Tablet of the Divine," and SR Wheel of Destiny "Man in the Mirror" can provide additional "Charity Vouchers" drops in "Path of the Church" stage rewards. Detailed bonuses are as follows:
(1) Method One: Keeper owns specific Awakener or Wheel of Destiny (not required to be deployed)
Awakener "Salvador": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 and above, Bonus 30%/40%/50%/60%.
SSR Wheel of Destiny "Tablet of the Divine": Stack 0/1/2/3 and above, Bonus 30%/40%/50%/60%.
SR Wheel of Destiny "Man in the Mirror": Stack 0/1/2/3 and above, Bonus 15%/20%/25%/30%.
(2) Method Two: Use specific Awakener or Wheel of Destiny for assistance
Awakener "Salvador": Bonus 10%.
SSR Wheel of Destiny "Tablet of the Divine": Bonus 10%.
SR Wheel of Destiny "Man in the Mirror": Bonus 5%.
2. For the same Awakener or Wheel of Destiny, only the higher "Glimmer Bonus" from the two methods will apply, not cumulative.
3. Different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny "Glimmer Bonuses" can stack, allowing Keepers to gain up to 150% "Glimmer Bonus" as per the rules above!

<Title:Resonance: Soul's Fork>
1. Keepers can obtain "Heart of Confession" by completing event achievements.
2. Spending "Heart of Confession" to activate "Resonance: Soul's Fork," you can gain the following benefits:
(1) Make Keepers stronger in the event plays "Path of the Church" and "Special Record: Color of Blood," making challenges easier.
(2) Increase Affinity gained after completing "Path of the Church" challenges.
(3) Activate the event play "Civic Kindness".

<Title:Civic Kindness>
1. After activating Resonance "Ease of Way," automatically gain 60 "Charity Vouchers" per hour, storing up to 25 hours.
2. After activating Resonance "Atonement, Atonement," additionally gain 1800 Rose Scrip per hour automatically.

<Title:Church Charity Sale>
1. Keepers can use "Charity Vouchers" to randomly exchange for items at the "Church Charity Sale" shop, with event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "Man in the Mirror," Lumen Core, and Pure Core waiting for you~
2. The Church Charity Sale features three shops, opening as follows:
Shop "Mrs. Gray's Store": Initially opened.
Shop "Big John's Fantastic Charity": Opens on the 4th day of the event.
Shop "Smith's Special Sale": Opens on the 7th day of the event.
3. Different shops offer different items, and Keepers can choose items based on their needs.
4. Each shop contains both special and regular items, each exchange costing 600 "Charity Vouchers" for five random items from the shop.
5. Once all special items in a shop are exchanged, Keepers can request shop restocking or continue exchanging. When all items in a shop are exchanged, restocking must be chosen to continue.
6. For the first two restocks, the remaining quantity of all items in the shop is replenished to the maximum. From the third restock onward, only regular items are replenished. Unexchanged item quantities will not be retained after restocking. Keepers should choose wisely before restocking~

<Title:Special Record>
1. During the event, "Special Record: Color of Blood" is available for free. Every 2 days, new investigation events for "Color of Blood" will be released. Completing them rewards Posse "Miracle Arrival," Pure Core, Investigation Badge, and Keeper's Experience.
2. After the event, the investigation progress of "Color of Blood" will be retained. Completing unfinished investigation events post-event will grant the same rewards. If "Color of Blood" isn't unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked post-event for 7 "Reality Verge".
3. Limited-time achievement rewards are available during the event. Completing all investigation events in "Color of Blood" will grant the avatar "By the Silver Key: Salvador" in activity achievements. Achievement rewards are only obtainable during the event period; they cannot be claimed or completed after the event ends.

]]
