  Activity_46609_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = "Hysteria. Call it mania, call it a shattering of the mind; in this era, the diagnosis is a death sentence. Fortunately, the scientists and investigators of Mythag are possessed by a madness of their own: they are determined to conquer this terror."
  },
  Activity_46609_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "The event has ended. Currently, only \"Ego Dissection\" is available."
  },
  Activity_46609_ActivityTips = {
    Text = "<Title:Event Overview>\n1. During the event, Keepers can collect event currency \"Memory Puzzle\" through limited-time gameplay modes: \"Memory Encoding,\" \"Edge Storage,\" and \"Achievement Rewards.\" \"Memory Puzzle\" can be used to purchase items in \"Personality Analysis,\" including the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny \"Silver Cod's Determination,\" Luminous Core, Pure Core, Aetheric Stone, and abundant cultivation materials.\n2. Completing \"Task Record: Tranquil Fission\" grants a new Posse \"All of Her.\" During the event, \"Task Record: Tranquil Fission\" is available for limited free access, and completing the activity achievements also grants the event-exclusive avatar \"By the Silver Key: '24'!\"\n\n<Title:Event Time>\n1. April 27th, 9:00 - May 18th, 9:00 (GMT+8): All event gameplay modes are accessible, and \"Task Record: Tranquil Fission\" is available for limited free access.\n2. May 18th, 9:00 - May 25th, 9:00 (GMT+8): Only \"Personality Analysis\" and Achievement Rewards are accessible. \"Task Record: Tranquil Fission\" requires consuming 7 Reality Verge to unlock.\n\n<Title:Memory Encoding>\n1. \"Memory Encoding\" consists of 5 levels. Keepers can unlock them sequentially by completing levels 2/4/6/8/10 of \"Task Record: Tranquil Fission.\"\n2. Each level has 7 difficulty settings, with recommended levels ranging from 15 to 65. All difficulties are unlocked by default. Enemies and events in each level may change randomly.\n3. Alumni aid and \"Resonance: Dissociative Syndrome\" can help clear levels more easily.\n4. Each attempt costs 120 Menophin. The higher the difficulty, the more \"Memory Puzzle\" can be obtained upon clearing. Additionally, Keepers can choose to double their challenge, consuming 240 Menophin to receive double the \"Memory Puzzle\" and Keeper's Experience.\n\n<Title:Rational Bonus>\n1. Keepers with specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be deployed) can receive additional drop bonuses for \"Memory Puzzles\" in the rewards for \"Memory Encoding\" level tasks, as detailed below:\nAwakener \"24\": Enlightenment 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 15%/20%/25%/30%.\nAwakener \"Daffodil\": Enlightenment 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 15%/20%/25%/30%.\nSSR Wheel of Destiny \"Aberrant Devour\": Stack Level 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 15%/20%/25%/30%.\nSSR Wheel of Destiny \"Treasured Rarity\": Stack Level 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 15%/20%/25%/30%.\nSR Wheel of Destiny \"Silver Cod's Determination\": Stack Level 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 15%/20%/25%/30%.\n2. Different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny's \"Rational Bonuses\" are calculated additively.\n\n<Title:Resonance: Dissociative Syndrome>\n1. Keepers can obtain \"Divided Heart\" by completing activity achievements.\n2. Consuming \"Divided Heart\" to activate \"Resonance: Dissociative Syndrome\" grants the following bonuses:\n(1) Strengthens Keepers in the event gameplay modes \"Memory Encoding\" and \"Task Record: Tranquil Fission,\" making challenges easier.\n(2) Enhances rewards obtained after completing \"Memory Encoding\" challenges.\n(3) Activates the event gameplay mode \"Edge Storage.\"\n\n<Title:Edge Storage>\nAfter activating Resonance \"Diagnosis: Shattered Self,\" automatically obtain 60 \"Memory Puzzle α\" every hour, with a maximum storage of 25 hours.\n\n<Title:Task Record>\n1. During the event, \"Task Record: Tranquil Fission\" can be unlocked for free. New investigation events for \"Tranquil Fission\" will be released every 2 days. Completing investigation events grants rewards such as the Posse \"All of Her,\" Pure Core, Investigation Badges, and Keeper's Experience.\n2. After the event ends, the investigation progress of \"Task Record: Tranquil Fission\" will be retained. Completing any unfinished investigation events during the event period will grant consistent investigation rewards. If \"Task Record: Tranquil Fission\" was not unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked by consuming 7 Reality Verge after the event ends.\n3. Limited-time achievement rewards will be introduced during the event. Keepers can claim the avatar \"By the Silver Key: '24'\" after completing all investigation events of \"Task Record: Tranquil Fission.\" Achievement rewards are only available during the event period and cannot be completed or claimed after the event ends.\n\n\n"
  },
