  Activity_48719_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "Event has Ended. Only \"Spawn of Lust\" is currently available."
  },
  Activity_48719_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event, Keepers can collect event currency "The mother seed" through limited-time gameplay "Chaotic Desire" and "Achievement Rewards." The "The mother seed" can be exchanged for rewards in "Desire Wave," including Lumen Core, Pure Core, and abundant cultivation materials.
2. During the event, by completing "Operation 2-9: Normal," Keepers can also participate in "Reproductive Frenzy," unlocking it without meeting the Affinity requirement of Awakener. Moreover, the required number of "Reality Verge" consumed becomes only 1!
3. The arrival of a mysterious Power seems to help you establish a deeper relationship with Awakener, and all Affinity obtained during the event is doubled!

<Title:Event Duration>
1. From May 18, 9:00 - June 3, 9:00 (GMT+8), all content in the Event Overview can be participated in.
2. From June 3, 9:00 - June 10, 9:00 (GMT+8), only "Desire Wave" and "Achievement Rewards" remain available; all other content ends and is unavailable.

<Title:Chaotic Desire>
1. "Chaotic Desire" includes 10 material stages requiring no exploration, directly entering Battle, opening one each day.
2. In these material stages, you will directly Rouse all Awakeners and receive pre-set Relics, and receive help from Thais after 6 turns.
3. Each challenge will Exhaust 60 points of Menophin, and once cleared, these material stages support recreating.
4. The use of Alumni can assist you in clearing more easily.

<Title:Greed Bonus>
1. Keepers owning specific Awakens or Wheels of Destiny (not required to deploy) can make "Chaotic Desire" stage tasks drop extra "The mother seed" (including recreating), with specific bonuses as follows:
Awakener "Thais": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%
SSR Wheel "Merciful Nurturing": Stack 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%
SR Wheel "Burning Farewell": Stack 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%
2. Different Awakeners or Wheels' "Greed Bonuses" are calculated additively.

<Title:Reproductive Frenzy>
1. After clearing "Operation 7-3: Normal," a new special investigation content "Reproductive Frenzy" opens!
2. With the arrival of "Desire Wave" activity, Awakeners are affected by mysterious Power, falling into "Reproductive Frenzy" State... Keepers, be careful!
3. When an Awakener's Affinity reaches level 10, you can unlock the "Reproductive Frenzy Event" for that Awakener, using 7 "Reality Verge" for unlocking, completing it grants 1 "Pure Core"!
4. During the "Desire Wave" event (before June 3, 9:00), the conditions are loosened to clearing "Operation 2-9: Normal," and Awakeners can unlock "Reproductive Frenzy Event" without Affinity requirements, and the "Reality Verge" consumption requirement becomes just 1!

<Title:Affinity Doubled>
1. The arrival of a mysterious Power seems to help you establish a deeper relationship with Awakener, during the event, all Affinity obtained is doubled!
2. With other Affinity bonus rewards, calculations follow a multiplication method, such as using assistance Affinity bonus.
<Title:Achievement Rewards>
1. Completing all tasks will earn you rewards: 800 Silvers, a large number of "The mother seed," event-limited SR Wheel "Burning Farewell" *16, event-limited avatar "By the Silver Key: Thais."
2. Includes 16 tasks: clearing each stage of "Chaotic Desire" once, accumulating 10/20/30/40/50 recreations in "Chaotic Desire," completing all Activity Achievements.



]]
  },
