  Activity_51127_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. The gameplay event "The Magic of Stories" is back for a limited time! Keepers can access the "Arcane Codex Emporium" and "Achievement Rewards" to obtain the event-exclusive Wheel of Destiny "35mm Magic" and the event-exclusive avatar "By the Silver Key: Lily" once again!
2. During the event, "Special Operation: The Magic of Stories" will be available for limited free access.

<Title:Event Time>
1. From June 3rd, 9:00 to June 17th, 9:00 (GMT+8), all content in the event introduction can be participated in.
2. From June 17th, 9:00 to June 24th, 9:00 (GMT+8), only the "Arcane Codex Emporium" and "Achievement Rewards" will remain accessible; other content will have ended and cannot be participated in.

<Title:Script Mystery>
1. "Plotted Mystery" consists of 9 material levels, with one level unlocking automatically each day. After unlocking, you must clear the preceding Special Operation level to challenge it.
2. Each challenge consumes 60 Menophin points. Successful challenges reward you with the event currency "Drifting Inspiration" and cultivation materials. Clearing the material levels in this event supports reenactment.
3. You can use Alumnis support and "Resonance: Director Password" to help clear levels more easily.

<Title:Inspiration Bonus>
1. Keepers with specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required in the lineup) gain additional drop bonuses for "Drifting Inspiration" in the task rewards of "Plotted Mystery" (including reenactment). Specific bonuses are as follows:
Awakener "Lily": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%
SSR Wheel of Destiny "Grace Through Pain": Stacking 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%
SR Wheel of Destiny "35mm Magic": Stacking 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%
2. Different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny's "Inspiration Bonuses" stack.

<Title:Resonance: Director's Password>
