<Title:Achievement Rewards>
1. Completing achievement tasks grants the event-exclusive avatar "By the Silver Key: Lily," event currency "Drifting Inspiration," and Silver.
2. Includes 25 tasks: clearing each level of "Plotted Mystery" once, using each Realm team to clear "Plotted Mystery" 1/2 times, clearing each investigation event in "Special Operation: The Magic of Stories" once, and completing all event achievements.

<Title:Special Operation>
1. During the event, "Special Operation: The Magic of Stories" can be unlocked for free.
2. In "Special Operation: The Magic of Stories," Keepers will challenge using a special team configuration that includes the story preset "Lily."

<Title:Revival Compensation>
