2. During the event, completing "Achievement Rewards" tasks grants the event-exclusive avatar "By the Silver Key: Sorel," the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "Million Loving Gaze," Silver, and plenty of event currency "Spirit Bird Fans".
