<Title:Event Duration>
1. From 9:00 on July 1st to 9:00 on July 15th (GMT+8), all event content is available.
2. From 9:00 on July 15th to 9:00 on July 22nd (GMT+8), only "Golden Celebration" and "Achievement Rewards" remain available; other content is no longer accessible.

<Title:Rose Memories>
1. "Rose Memories" includes 9 stages, with one opening each day.
2. Each challenge consumes 120 Menophin, yielding different materials along with event currency "Spirit Bird Fans".
3. This event's stages are direct combat material stages. Clearing them allows "Replay"! Each "Replay" consumes 120 Menophin.
4. Note: Using "Replay" does not award Affinity.

<Title:Fan Boosts>
1. Having specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not necessary to deploy them) can boost "Spirit Bird Fans" drops from "Rose Memories" stages (including replays) as follows:
Awakener "Sorel": Enlighten 0/1/2/3+, boost 20%/30%/40%/50%
SSR Wheel of Destiny "By Rose Alone": Stack Lv. 0/1/2/3+, boost 20%/30%/40%/50%
SR Wheel of Destiny "Million Loving Gaze": Stack Lv. 0/1/2/3+, boost 20%/30%/40%/50%
2. Fan Boosts from different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny are additive.

<Title:Special Mission Report>
1. During the event, Keepers who have previously unlocked "Special Mission Report: Rose Eulogy" will be compensated with 600 "Spirit Bird Fans" upon relocking.
2. In "Rose Eulogy," Keepers use a special lineup with pre-set storyline "Sorel" for challenges.]]
