  Activity_54596_ActivityName = {
    Text = "Gift of Knowledge"
  },
  Activity_54596_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. After completing designated event missions, Keepers can claim generous rewards including Protoparadise, Book of Rotation, Prototype Horizon, Timeloop Copy, Soul Rewind Core, Fate Rewind Core, Faded Legacy limited Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny, Astral Reign limited Awakeners and Wheels of Destiny, as well as exclusive rewards such as the event-limited avatar frame "Silver Matrix" and Keeper EXP acceleration!
2. This event is permanently available. After completing all missions and claiming all rewards, the event will end and no longer be displayed after 9:00 (GMT+8) the following day.

<Title:Supreme Tribute>
1. Completing designated event missions grants the "Supreme Tribute" Effect, which accelerates Keeper EXP gain, up to a maximum of 100%. When multiple "Supreme Tribute" Effects are active simultaneously, the highest acceleration Effect is applied.
2. When unlocking or obtaining a higher-level "Supreme Tribute" Effect, bonus Keeper EXP is immediately granted based on the acceleration rate and the current total Keeper EXP eligible for acceleration.
3. After unlocking "Supreme Tribute," each time the Keeper earns Keeper EXP, additional Keeper EXP corresponding to the acceleration rate will also be earned.
4. Please note that the bonus Keeper EXP from "Supreme Tribute" does not count toward the total Keeper EXP eligible for acceleration.
5. Current total Keeper EXP eligible for acceleration: {s1}.
6. Cumulative bonus Keeper EXP earned from acceleration: {s2} ({s3}%).]]
