  Activity_56427_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event, Keepers can participate in limited-time activities "Path of the Church," "Civic Goodwill," and "Achievement Rewards" to collect the event currency "Charity Vouchers". "Charity Vouchers" can be exchanged for random items at the "Church Charity Bazaar," including the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "Man in the Mirror," Pure Core, Luminous Core, etc.
2. During the event, "Special Record: The Color of Blood" will be free to access. Completing event achievements will also grant the event-exclusive avatar "By the Silver Key: Salvador"!

<Title:Event Duration>
1. From 9:00 on August 26 to 9:00 on September 9 (GMT+8), all event content will be available.
2. From 9:00 on September 9 to 9:00 on September 16 (GMT+8), only the "Church Charity Bazaar" and "Achievement Rewards" will remain available, while other content will end and be unavailable.

<Title:Path of the Church>
1. "Path of the Church" consists of 5 levels, with one level unlocking every 2 days.
2. Each challenge consumes 120 points of Menophin. Successfully completing a challenge will reward you with "Charity Vouchers".
3. After clearing a level, the "Replay" feature for that level is unlocked. Note: Using the "Replay" feature does not grant Affinity.
4. You can use Alumni support and "Resonance: Soul's Fork" to help you clear levels more easily.

<Title:Glimmer Boost>
1. Under the influence of "Soul's Glimmer," Keepers with specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be deployed) can receive additional drop boosts of "Charity Vouchers" from "Path of the Church" level rewards (including Replay). Specific boosts are as follows:
Awakener "Salvador": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 and above, boost 20%/30%/40%/50%.
SSR Wheel of Destiny "Tablet of Scriptures": Stack 0/1/2/3 and above, boost 20%/30%/40%/50%.
SR Wheel of Destiny "Man in the Mirror": Stack 0/1/2/3 and above, boost 20%/30%/40%/50%.
2. The "Glimmer Boost" of different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny is cumulative.
3. Notably, the reward for the first completion of the Madness difficulty challenge will not be affected by "Glimmer Boost".

<Title:Resonance: Soul's Fork>
1. Keepers can obtain "Heart of Repentance" by completing event achievements.
2. Use "Heart of Repentance" to activate "Resonance: Soul's Fork" to gain the following boosts:
(1) Make Keepers stronger in the event activities "Path of the Church" and "Special Record: The Color of Blood" for easier challenges.
(2) Increase Affinity gained after completing "Path of the Church" challenges.
(3) Activate the event activity "Civic Goodwill".

<Title:Civic Goodwill>
1. After activating the resonance "Easy Method," you will automatically receive 60 "Charity Vouchers" per hour, up to a maximum storage of 25 hours.
2. After activating the resonance "Atonement Unending," you will additionally receive 1800 Rose Scrip per hour.

<Title:Church Charity Bazaar>
1. The "Church Charity Bazaar" has three shops opening at the following times:
"Mrs. Gray's Little Shop": Opens at 9:00, August 26.
"Big John's Wonderful Bazaar": Opens at 9:00, August 29.
"Smith's Sales": Opens at 9:00, September 1.
2. Each exchange will consume 1000 "Charity Vouchers" and randomly reward five items from the shop.
3. Each shop's item rewards are divided into "Special Items" and "Common Items". Reset rules are:
(1) First 2 resets: When "Special Items" are out of stock, Keepers can choose to reset, which will refill the stock of both "Special Items" and "Common Items". You can also continue exchanging; once "Common Items" are out of stock, a reset is required to continue exchanging.
(2) From the 3rd reset onwards: Resetting is allowed only when "Common Items" are out of stock. It will refill the stock of "Common Items," but "Special Items" will no longer be reset.
4. After 9:00 (GMT+8) on September 16, remaining "Charity Vouchers" will be recycled at a rate of 5000 Rose Scrip per 200 vouchers. Please check your mail for details.

<Title:Special Record>
1. "Special Record: The Color of Blood" will be free during the event.
2. After the event, investigation progress for "Special Record: The Color of Blood" will be retained. If it is not unlocked during the event, it can be unlocked afterwards by consuming 7 "Reality Verge".
3. Whether during the event or not, clearing "Special Record: The Color of Blood" will reward "Posse: Miracle's Dawn".

<Title:Reprint Compensation>
1. Keepers who previously unlocked "Special Record: The Color of Blood" will receive 700 "Charity Vouchers" as compensation for unlocking it again during this reprint event.
2. Keepers who previously obtained the event-exclusive avatar "By the Silver Key: Salvador" will receive 2000 "Charity Vouchers" as compensation if obtained again.
3. Keepers who previously obtained the activation material "Heart of Repentance" will receive 5000 Rose Scrip for each excess "Heart of Repentance" obtained.
]]
