SR Wheel of Destiny "Fate Roulette": Stacking 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%
2. Different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny's "Chip Bonus" will be calculated in an additive manner.
3. Specially, the first-time challenge reward of Madness difficulty will not be affected by the "Chip Bonus."

<Title:Lucky Club>
1. "Lucky Club" is only open from August 12, 9:00 - September 2, 9:00 (GMT+8).
2. After September 2, 9:00 (GMT+8), any remaining unexchanged "Winning Chip" will be recaptured at the rate of "Rose Scrip *40" for each exchange. Keepers should check their mail for this.

<Title:Task Record>
1. In "Task Record: Happy Hunting!," Keepers will use a special team including the story preset "Ryker" for challenges.
2. Clearing "Task Record: Happy Hunting!" will reward the new key item "A Gun's Cry."]]
