  Activity_56433_BannerText = {
    Text = "Limited-Time Event Now Available!"
  },
  Activity_56434_ActivityName = {
    Text = "Omnium Gateway"
  },
  Activity_56434_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = "No one knows how long she has stood silent guard at the Ultimate Gate.\nShe never intended to manifest in any tangible world, nor to be swept into any spatio-temporal current.\nThere, at the Gate, she remained undisturbed—\nUntil the moment her eyes met yours."
  },
  Activity_56434_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "Event has Ended. Only \"Echo\" is currently available."
  },
  Activity_56434_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event, Keepers can collect the event currency "End Pointer" through the limited-time gameplay "Final Test" and "Achievement Rewards". "End Pointer" can be exchanged for generous rewards in "Echo," including the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "Gate of Truth," Pure Core, Luminous Core, Sage Shard, Mimetic Crystal, and more.
2. During the event, completing the tasks for "Achievement Rewards" will grant the event-exclusive avatar "By the Silver Key: Tawil," the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "Gate of Truth," Silver, and a large amount of event currency "End Pointer".

<Title:Event Duration>
1. From November 18, 9:00 to December 2, 9:00 (GMT+8), all event content is available for participation.
2. From December 2, 9:00 to December 9, 9:00 (GMT+8), only "Echo" and "Achievement Rewards" will be retained; other content will have ended and is no longer available for participation.

<Title:Final Test>
1. The "Final Test" includes 9 levels, with one level automatically opening each day.
2. Each challenge will consume 120 Menophin, and by challenging different levels, players will not only obtain different material drops but also gain event currency "End Pointer".
3. This event's levels are direct combat material levels and can be replayed after clearing! Each "Replay" costs 120 Menophin.
4. Please note: When using the "Replay" function, Affinity will not be gained.

<Title:End Pointer Bonus>
1. Keepers with specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be in formation) can gain additional drop bonuses for "End Pointer" in "Final Test" level task rewards (including replay), with specifics as follows:
Awakener "Tawil": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%
SSR Wheel of Destiny "Wheel Unseen": Stacking 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%
SR Wheel of Destiny "Gate of Truth": Stacking 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%
2. The "End Pointer Bonus" from different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny will be calculated in a stacking manner.
3. Specially, the first-time challenge reward for Madness difficulty will not be affected by the "End Pointer Bonus".

<Title:Echo>
1. "Echo" is only open from November 18, 9:00 to December 9, 9:00 (GMT+8).
2. After December 9, 9:00 (GMT+8), any remaining unexchanged "End Pointer" will be reclaimed at a rate of "Rose Scrip *40" per exchange. Please, Keepers, check your mail for details.]]
  },
  Activity_56434_BannerText = {
    Text = "Limited-Time Event Now Available!"
  },
  Activity_56435_ActivityName = {
    Text = "Manifold Healing: Rerun"
  },
  Activity_56435_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = "Hysteria. Call it mania, call it a shattering of the mind; in this era, the diagnosis is a death sentence. Fortunately, the scientists and investigators of Mythag are possessed by a madness of their own: they are determined to conquer this terror."
  },
  Activity_56435_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "The event has ended. Currently, only \"Ego Dissection\" is available."
  },
  Activity_56435_ActivityTips = {
    Text = "<Title:Event Overview>\n1. During the event, Keepers can collect event currency \"Memory Puzzle\" through limited-time modes \"Memory Encoding,\" \"Edge Storage,\" and \"Achievement Rewards.\" \"Memory Puzzle\" can be used in \"Persona Analysis\" to purchase items, including the event-exclusive SR Destiny Wheel \"Determination of Silver Cod,\" Lumen Core, Pure Core, etc.\n2. During the event, \"Special Record: Tranquil Fission\" is available for limited free access. Completing activity achievements also earns the event-exclusive avatar \"By the Silver Key: '24'.\"\n\n<Title:Event Duration>\n1. From 9:00 on October 21 to 9:00 on November 4 (GMT+8), all event modes are available.\n2. From 9:00 on November 4 to 9:00 on November 11 (GMT+8), only \"Persona Analysis\" and Achievement Rewards are accessible.\n\n<Title:Memory Encoding>\n1. \"Memory Encoding\" includes 5 stages, with one opening every 2 days.\n2. Each challenge consumes 120 Menophin, and successful challenges grant event currency.\n3. After clearing a stage, the \"Reenact\" feature for that stage unlocks. Note: No affinity is gained from using \"Reenact.\"\n4. Use Alumni Assistance and \"Resonance: Dissociative Syndrome\" to help clear stages more easily.\n\n<Title:Rational Bonus>\n1. Keepers with specific Awakeners or Destiny Wheels (not required to be deployed) receive extra drops of \"Memory Puzzle\" from \"Memory Encoding\" tasks, as follows:\nAwakener \"24\": Enlighten 0/1/2/3+, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\nSSR Destiny Wheel \"Aberrant Devour\": Stack 0/1/2/3+, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\nSR Destiny Wheel \"Determination of Silver Cod\": Stack 0/1/2/3+, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.\n2. Rational Bonuses from different Awakeners or Destiny Wheels stack.\n3. Special note: First clear rewards for Madness difficulty are not affected by Rational Bonus.\n\n<Title:Resonance: Dissociative Syndrome>\n1. Keepers can earn \"Heart of Split\" by completing event achievements.\n2. Use \"Heart of Split\" to activate \"Resonance: Dissociative Syndrome,\" granting the following benefits:\n(1) Improve Keeper's strength in \"Memory Encoding\" and \"Special Record: Tranquil Fission,\" making challenges easier.\n(2) Increase rewards from \"Memory Encoding\" challenges.\n(3) Activate \"Edge Storage\" event mode.\n\n<Title:Edge Storage>\n1. After activating \"Resonance: Cognitive Resonance,\" automatically gain 60 \"Memory Puzzle α\" per hour, up to 25 hours.\n2. After activating \"Resonance: Cognitive Affinity,\" automatically gain 30 \"Memory Puzzle β\" per hour, up to 25 hours.\n\n<Title:Special Record>\n1. During the event, \"Special Record: Tranquil Fission\" is free to unlock.\n2. After the event, progress in \"Special Record: Tranquil Fission\" is retained, and unfinished investigations can still grant the same rewards. If \"Special Record: Tranquil Fission\" was not unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked after the event for 7 Reality Verge.\n3. Regardless of event timing, clearing \"Special Record: Tranquil Fission\" always grants \"Posse: Her Entirety.\"\n\n<Title:Reissue Compensation>\n1. Keepers who previously unlocked \"Special Record: Tranquil Fission\" will receive 700 \"Memory Puzzle α\" as compensation during this reissue event.\n2. Keepers who previously obtained the event-exclusive avatar \"By the Silver Key: '24'\" will receive 2000 \"Memory Puzzle α\" upon duplicate acquisition.\n3. Keepers who previously acquired the resonance material \"Heart of Split\" will receive 5000 Rose Scrip for each extra \"Heart of Split.\"\n"
  },
  Activity_56435_BannerText = {
    Text = "Limited-Time Event Now Available!"
  },
  Activity_56436_ActivityName = {
    Text = "Feast of Flames: Rerun"
  },
  Activity_56436_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = [[
Isarawu, City in the Lake, is said to be the homeland of Wanda.
This time you will pass through the Gate of Dreams and arrive at the ancient towers filled with clock tongues...]]
  },
  Activity_56436_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "Event has Ended. Only \"Wanda's Treasure Vault\" is currently available."
  },
  Activity_56436_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event, Keepers can collect event currency "Primal Shinbone," "Tornoceras," and "Spiral Ruins" through the limited-time gameplay "Feast of Flames" and "Achievement Rewards". These currencies can be used in "Wanda's Treasure Vault" to purchase items, including the event-exclusive SR Destiny Wheel "The Gaze of Isarawu," Lumen Core, Pure Core, etc.
2. During the event, "Psyche Deepdive: Feast of Flames" will have limited free access, and completing event achievements grants the event-exclusive avatar "By the Silver Key: Wanda"!

<Title:Event Time>
1. From 9:00 AM on September 23 to 9:00 AM on October 7 (GMT+8), all event gameplay is available.
2. From 9:00 AM on October 7 to 9:00 AM on October 14 (GMT+8), only "Wanda's Treasure Vault" and achievement rewards are accessible.

<Title:City in the Lake>
1. There are 7 stages in "City in the Lake," one unlocks automatically each day.
2. Each challenge consumes 120 Menophin, and successful challenges yield event currency.
3. After clearing a stage, the "Reenact" function for that stage unlocks. Note: using "Reenact" won't earn Affinity.
4. You can use Alumnis support and "Resonance: Secret Order" to aid in completing stages more easily.

<Title:Precious Bonus>
1. Owning specific Awakeners or Destiny Wheels (not required in battle) grants additional drops of event currency in "City in the Lake" stages, with specific bonuses as follows:
Awakener "Wanda": Enlighten levels 0/1/2/3+, bonuses of 20%/30%/40%/50%.
SSR Destiny Wheel "Queen's Edict": Ascension levels 0/1/2/3+, bonuses of 20%/30%/40%/50%.
SR Destiny Wheel "The Gaze of Isarawu": Ascension levels 0/1/2/3+, bonuses of 20%/30%/40%/50%.
2. Different Awakeners or Destiny Wheels' "Precious Bonuses" stack in calculations.
3. Note, the first completion reward at Madness difficulty isn't affected by Precious Bonuses.

<Title:Resonance: Secret Order>
1. Keepers can earn "Heart of Hedonism" by completing event achievements.
2. Using "Heart of Hedonism" activates "Resonance: Secret Order," making Keepers stronger and yielding extra event currency in "City in the Lake".

<Title:Psyche Deepdive>
1. During the event, "Feast of Flames" will be free to unlock.
2. Post-event, progress in "Feast of Flames" is retained, and unfinished investigation events still provide the same rewards. If "Feast of Flames" isn't unlocked during the event, it can be accessed later by consuming 3 "Reality Verge".
3. Completion of "Feast of Flames" yields "Posse: Feast of Decay" regardless of event period.

<Title:Rerun Compensation>
1. Keepers who had previously unlocked "Psyche Deepdive: Feast of Flames" will receive 300 "Primal Shinbone" as compensation if re-unlocked during this rerun.
2. For previously obtained event-exclusive avatar "By the Silver Key: Wanda," duplicates convert to 2000 "Primal Shinbone".
3. For previously obtained activation resonance material "Heart of Hedonism," each surplus converts to 5000 "Rose Scrip".
]]
  },
