  Activity_65387_ActivityName = {
    Text = "School Cat's Apology"
  },
  Activity_65387_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = "Due to recent vulnerabilities in the school's protective measures, <Del:\"Suggested Translation, Red Dot\"> Dissolution Harassment incidents on campus have been increasing, causing great inconvenience to students. Therefore, the school administration has set up multiple supply points to distribute materials as compensation. (Given the responsibility for facility management errors, all supply materials this time are carried entirely by the School Cat.)"
  },
  Activity_65387_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Overview>
Recently, due to loopholes in the school's protective measures, there has been an increasing number of <Del>"temporary text, red dot"> dissolution incidents disturbing the campus, causing significant inconvenience to the students. Therefore, the school administration has set up multiple supply points to distribute inventory as compensation. (Due to responsibility for facility management errors, the distribution of materials will be entirely handled by the school cat.)

<Title:Event Rules>
During the event, Keepers can log in daily to claim 500 Silver from "The School Cat's Apology," with a maximum of 5 claims.
Rewards will unlock sequentially based on the cumulative daily logins of the Keepers, and the daily login rewards will refresh at 9 AM (GMT+8).]]
  },
  Activity_65387_BannerText = {
    Text = "Sign in to claim Silver"
  },
  Activity_65502_ActivityName = {
    Text = "Progressive Rhythm: Duet"
  },
  Activity_65502_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = "Keepers may choose and Awaken one of the following limited Wheels of Destiny!"
  },
  Activity_65502_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Overview>
In the mysterious Black Pool, where clouds of intrigue swirl, the Wheel of Destiny turns repeatedly. Guided by Hameln's music, countless melodies harmonize into the Wheel of your journey. May their aid accompany you until the final note of the concluding symphony.

<Title:Event Rules>
During the event, log in for one day to select and awaken one of the following 12 limited Wheels, including: Hymn of the Sovereign, Treasured Rarity, By Rose Alone, Grace Through Pain, Shrouded Birth, Queen's Edict, Tablet of Scriptures, Aberrant Devour, Power of the Pious, The Last Verse, Merciful Nurturing, and Hour of Fortune.]]
  },
  Activity_65502_BannerText = {
    Text = "Claim a limited Wheel of Destiny for free"
  },
