  },
  Activity_67721_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event, Keepers can collect three types of "Poems" through the limited-time gameplay "Garden of Recollections," "Muse's Kiss," and "Achievement Rewards". These Poems can be exchanged in "Colette's Flower Shop" for item rewards, including the event-limited SR Wheel of Destiny "Poetic Bygone Days," Purified Core, Luminous Core, Aetheric Shard, Mimetic Crystal, and more.
2. During the event, "Special Ops: Rose's Abode" will be available for free.

<Title:Event Duration>
1. August 25 9:00 - September 8 9:00 (GMT+8), all event content will be available.
2. September 8 9:00 - September 15 9:00 (GMT+8), only "Colette's Flower Shop" and "Achievement Rewards" will remain available. All other content will no longer be accessible.

<Title: Garden of Recollections>
1. "Garden of Recollections" contains 5 stages, with a new one unlocking automatically every 2 days.
2. Each challenge consumes 120 Menophin. Successfully completing a challenge rewards event currency "Poems of Sorrow," "Poems of Regret," and "Poems of Joy".
3. After completing a stage, the "Reenact" function for that stage unlocks. Please note: Using the "Reenact" function does not grant Affinity.
4. You may use Alumnis for assistance and activate "Resonance: Garden Dirge" to make clearing stages easier.

<Title: Poem Bonuses>
1. Possessing specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be deployed) grants bonus drops of "Poems of Sorrow," "Poems of Regret," and "Poems of Joy" (including Reenact) from "Garden of Recollections" stage rewards. The bonuses are as follows:
 Awakener "Horla": Enlightenment 0/1/2/3+, Bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%
 SSR Wheel of Destiny "The Last Verse": Ascension 0/1/2/3+, Bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%
