<Title:Event Duration>
1. From March 24, 9:00 - April 7, 9:00 (GMT+8), all event content will be available for participation.
2. From April 7, 9:00 - April 14, 9:00 (GMT+8), only the "Church Charity Bazaar" and "Achievement Rewards" will remain available, all other content will be concluded and inaccessible.

<Title:The Path of the Church>
1. "The Path of the Church" consists of 5 stages, with one unlocking every 2 days.
2. Each challenge will exhaust 120 Menophin, and successful challenges will grant you event currency "Charity Coupons."
3. After completing a stage, the "Reenact" function for that stage will be unlocked. Note: You cannot gain Affinity when using the "Reenact" function.
4. You can use Alumni support and "Resonance: Soul's Fork" to help you pass the stages more easily.

<Title:Glimmer Bonus>
1. Under the influence of "Soul Glimmer," Keepers with specific Awakeners or Wheels of destiny (not required to be deployed) can gain extra drop bonuses for "Charity Coupons" from "The Path of the Church" stage rewards, including "Reenact." The specific bonuses are as follows:
Awakener "Salvador": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
SSR Wheel of destiny "Tablet of Scriptures": Stacks 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
SR Wheel of destiny "Man in the mirror": Stacks 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
2. Different Awakeners or Wheels of destiny "Glimmer Bonuses" are accumulated.
3. The Madness difficulty first-clear challenge rewards are not affected by "Glimmer Bonuses."

<Title:Resonance: Soul's Fork>
1. Keepers can obtain "Heart of Repentance" by completing event achievements.
2. Consume "Heart of Repentance" to activate "Resonance: Soul's Fork," and gain the following advantages:
(1) Make Keepers stronger in the event gameplays "The Path of the Church" and "Special Dispatch: The Color of Blood," making challenges easier.
(2) Increase Affinity gained after completing "The Path of the Church" challenges.
(3) Activate the event gameplay "Citizen's Goodwill."

<Title:Citizen's Goodwill>
1. After activating the resonance "Easy Method," automatically obtain 60 "Charity Coupons" per hour, up to 25 hours can be stored.
2. After activating the resonance "Atonement, Atonement," automatically obtain an additional 1800 Golden rose coupons per hour.

<Title:Church Charity Bazaar>
1. The "Church Charity Bazaar" has three shops, with the following opening times:
"Mrs. Gray's Little Shop": Opens on March 24, 9:00.
"Big John's Fantastic Charity Sale": Opens on March 27, 9:00.
"Smith's Special Sale": Opens on March 30, 9:00.
2. Each exchange will exhaust 750 "Charity Coupons," randomly granting five item rewards from the shop.
3. Item rewards in each shop are divided into "Special Items" and "Regular Items." Upon reset, remaining stock of Special Items can be replenished to the maximum, with rules as follows:
(1) First 2 resets: When there are no remaining quantities of "Special Items," Keepers can choose to reset. Upon reset, both "Special Items" and "Regular Items" remaining quantities will reset to maximum; they can also choose to continue exchanging, when "Regular Items" have no remaining quantities, reset must be done to continue exchanging.
(2) Starting from the 3rd reset: Only when there are no remaining quantities of "Regular Items" can reset be done, which will reset the "Regular Items" remaining quantities to maximum, "Special Items" will not reset.
4. After April 14, 9:00 (GMT+8), remaining "Charity Coupons" will be reclaimed at the rate of exchange for "Golden rose coupons*40" per coupon. Keepers please check the mail for the conversions.

<Title:Special Dispatch>
1. During the event, "Special Dispatch: The Color of Blood" will be available for free.
2. After the event ends, the Investigation progress of "Special Dispatch: The Color of Blood" will be retained, if it was not unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked after by exhausting "Reality Verge"*7.
3. Whether during or after the event, completing "Special Dispatch: The Color of Blood" grants "Posse: Miracle's Dawn."

<Title:Reprint Compensation>
