2. Keepers who have previously obtained the event-exclusive avatar "By the Silver Key: Salvador" will have it automatically converted into 1 "Formless One's Invitation" when obtained again.
3. Keepers who have previously obtained activation resonance materials "Heart of Repentance" will have each additional obtained "Heart of Repentance" automatically converted into "Golden rose coupons"*5000.
]]
