<Title:Chaotic Desire>
1. "Chaotic Desire" includes 10 material stages that require no exploration, only battle, with 1 stage unlocking each day.
2. In these material stages, you will directly Awaken all Awakeners and obtain preset Relics. Additionally, after 6 turns, you will receive help from Thais once.
