<Title:Greed Bonus>
1. Keepers possessing specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required in battle) can receive an additional drop enhancement of "The Mother Seed" in "Chaotic Desire" stage rewards (including Reenact). Specific enhancements are as follows:
Awakener "Thais": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 and above, boost 20%/30%/40%/50%
SSR Wheel of Destiny "Merciful Nurturing": Ascension 0/1/2/3 and above, boost 20%/30%/40%/50%
SR Wheel of Destiny "Kiss of Farewell": Ascension 0/1/2/3 and above, boost 20%/30%/40%/50%
2. "Greed Bonus" from different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny is calculated cumulatively.
3. Specifically, first-time challenge rewards in Madness difficulty are not affected by the above bonus.

<Title:Breeding Desire>
1. Each "Seed Exchange" will consume 1000 "The Mother Seed," randomly obtaining five item rewards from "Breeding Desire."
3. The item rewards in "Breeding Desire" are divided into "Special Items" and "Normal Items." Upon resetting, the remaining number of Special Item rewards can be reset to the limit, with specific rules being:
(1) For the first 4 resets: When there are no remaining "Special Items," the Keeper can choose to reset. The reset will refresh the remaining number of "Special Items" and "Normal Items" to the limit. You may also choose to continue exchanging. When there are also no remaining "Normal Items," a reset is required to continue exchanging.
(2) From the 5th reset onwards: A reset can only occur when there are no remaining "Normal Items." The reset will refresh the remaining number of "Normal Items" to the limit, while "Special Items" will no longer reset.

