  Activity_67735_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "Event has Ended. Only \"Spawn of Lust\" is currently available."
  },
  Activity_67735_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event, Keepers can collect the event currency "Seed of Abundance" through the limited-time gameplay "Chaotic Desire" and "Achievement Rewards." "Seed of Abundance" can be exchanged for rewards in "Spawn of Lust," including the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "Kiss of Farewell," Luminous Core, Pure Core, Aetheric Shard, and Mimetic Crystal, among others. 
2. During the event, the participation requirements for "Reproduction Frenzy" are relaxed to clearing Main Story: 1-2: Normal, and the Awakener affinity requirement is not needed to unlock the "Reproduction Frenzy Event." Additionally, the required number of "Reality Verge" is reduced to 1! 
3. A mysterious force seems to help you establish a deeper connection with the Awakeners, doubling the affinity gained through all means during the event! 

<Title:Chaotic Desire>
1. "Chaotic Desire" consists of 10 material stages that do not require exploration and feature direct combat, with one stage opening each day. 
2. In these material stages, all Awakeners will be roused and be equipped with preset Relics. Additionally, after 6 turns, you will receive assistance from Thais once. 
3. Each challenge will consume 120 Menophin, and successful challenges will yield materials and event currency. 
4. After clearing a stage, the "Reenact" function for that stage will be unlocked. Please note: using the "Reenact" function will not grant affinity. 
5. You can use support to assist you in clearing stages more easily. 

<Title:Desire Bonus>
1. Keepers with specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be deployed) can receive additional drop bonuses for "Seed of Abundance" in the "Chaotic Desire" stage task rewards (including reenact), with specific bonuses as follows: 
Awakener "Thais": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50% 
SSR Wheel of Destiny "Merciful Nurturing": Ascension 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50% 
SR Wheel of Destiny "Kiss of Farewell": Ascension 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50% 
2. Different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny's "Greed Bonus" are calculated in an additive manner. 
3. Notably, the first-time challenge rewards for Madness Difficulty will not be affected by the above bonuses. 

<Title:Spawn of Lust>
1. Each "Exchange Seed" will consume 750 "Seed of Abundance" and randomly grant five item rewards from "Spawn of Lust." 
3. The item rewards from "Spawn of Lust" are divided into "Special Items" and "Common Items." Upon resetting, the remaining quantity of special item rewards can be reset to the limit, with specific rules as follows: 
(1) For the first 4 resets: When there are no remaining "Special Items," Keepers can choose to reset, which will reset the remaining quantities of "Special Items" and "Common Items" to the limit. They may also choose to continue exchanging; when there are no remaining "Common Items," a reset must be performed to continue exchanging. 
(2) For the 5th reset and thereafter: A reset can only be performed when there are no remaining "Common Items," which will reset the remaining quantities of "Common Items" to the limit; "Special Items" will not be reset. 

<Title:Event Duration>
1. December 15, 9:00 - December 29, 9:00 (GMT+8), all content in the event overview can be participated in. 
2. December 29, 9:00 - January 5, 9:00 (GMT+8), only "Spawn of Lust" and "Achievement Rewards" will remain, and other content will no longer be available for participation. 
3. After January 5th, 9:00 (GMT+8), any unexchanged "Seed of Abundance" will be recycled at a rate of "Rose Scrip *40" per exchange; please check your mails for notifications.]]
  },
