3. Specially, the first clear reward for Madness difficulty challenge will not be affected by "Event Bonus."

<Title:Neural Therapy Room>
1. Each "Submit Report" consumes 1,000 "Diagnostic Reports" and randomly grants five item rewards from the "Neural Therapy Room."
2. The item rewards in the "Neural Therapy Room" are divided into "Special Items" and "Normal Items." Resetting allows the remaining quantity of special item rewards to be reset to the upper limit. The specific rules are:
(1) The first 5 resets: When no quantity of "Special Items" remains, Keepers can choose to reset, resetting the remaining quantity of "Special Items" and "Normal Items" to the limit; they can also choose to continue exchanging, and when no quantity of "Normal Items" remains, a reset is necessary to continue exchanging.
(2) From the 6th reset onwards: Resets can only occur when no quantity of "Normal Items" remains, resetting the remaining quantity of "Normal Items" to the limit, "Special Items" will not reset.
3. After April 28, 9:00 (GMT+8), the remaining unredeemed "Diagnostic Reports" will be recovered at a ratio of each for "Rose Scrip*40." Keepers, please ensure to check your mail.]]
