  Activity_68410_ActivityName = {
    Text = "Phantom of the Rain"
  },
  Activity_68410_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = "A destined encounter waits in the damp, hazy rain. You know her name and her face, and her voice still lulls you into a sense of ease. \nBut remember—only gods and devils are this desperate to satisfy human desires. \nTake a guess. Which one is she?"
  },
  Activity_68410_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "The event has ended. You can now only participate in \"Witch's Vault\"."
  },
  Activity_68410_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event, Keepers can collect event currency through time-limited gameplay "Witch's Shop" and "Achievement Rewards." Event currency can be used in "Witch's Treasury" for exchanges to obtain item rewards, including the event-limited SR Wheel of Destiny "Witch's Wide-brimmed Hat," Philosopher's Stone, Pure Core, and Lumen Core.
2. During the event, "Special Dispatch Record: Rainy Town Shadow" will be open for free, and completing the activity achievements can also earn you the event-limited avatar "By the Silver Key: Daffodil"!

<Title:Event Duration>
1. From 9:00, February 24 to 9:00, March 10 (GMT+8), all event contents are available for participation.
2. From 9:00, March 10 to 9:00, March 17 (GMT+8), only "Witch's Treasury" and "Achievement Rewards" remain available; other contents have ended and are unavailable.

<Title:Witch's Shop>
1. "Witch's Shop" contains 5 levels, with 1 opening automatically every 2 days.
2. Each challenge consumes 120 Menophin, and successful challenges will earn event currency.
3. After clearing the level, the "Revisit" function for that level is unlocked. Note: Using the "Revisit" function will not earn Affinity.
4. You can use Alumni assistance to help clear levels more easily.

<Title:Event Bonuses>
1. Keepers possessing specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be deployed) can grant additional drop bonuses (including Revisit) for "Pale Beast Skull," "Shadowy Beast Skull," and "Crimson Beast Skull" in "Witch's Shop" quest rewards. The specific bonuses are as follows:
Awakener "Daffodil": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus: 20%/30%/40%/50%
SSR Wheel of Destiny "Most Precious Collection": Stack Position 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus: 20%/30%/40%/50%
SR Wheel of Destiny "Witch's Wide-brimmed Hat": Stack Position 0/1/2/3 or above, bonus: 20%/30%/40%/50%
2. The "Event Bonuses" from different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny are calculated cumulatively.
3. Specifically, first clear rewards for challenges on Madness difficulty will not be affected by the "Event Bonuses."

<Title:Witch's Treasury>
1. There are three "Witch's Treasuries," opening at the following times:
"Solace's Delight": 9:00, February 24 ~ 9:00, March 17.
"Grandiose Secrets": 9:00, February 26 ~ 9:00, March 17.
"Treasured Wares": 9:00, February 28 ~ 9:00, March 17.
2. Each exchange consumes 750 "Pale Beast Skull"/"Shadowy Beast Skull"/"Crimson Beast Skull," randomly obtaining five item rewards from the treasury.
3. Each treasury's item rewards are divided into "Special Items" and "Common Items," and resetting allows the remaining quantity of specified item rewards to reset to the limit. The specific rules are:
(1) For the first 2 resets: After "Special Items" have no remaining quantity, Keepers can choose to reset, which will restore the remaining quantity of "Special Items" and "Common Items" to the limit; they can also choose to continue exchanging. When "Common Items" also have no remaining quantity, resetting is necessary to continue exchanging.
(2) From the 3rd reset: Resetting can only take place when "Common Items" have no remaining quantity, and it will reset the remaining quantity of "Common Items" to the limit; "Special Items" will no longer reset.

<Title:Special Dispatch Record>
1. During the event, "Special Dispatch Record: Rainy Town Shadow" will be open for free.
2. After the event ends, the investigation progress of "Special Dispatch Record: Rainy Town Shadow" will be retained. If not unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked post-event by consuming "Reality Verge"*7.
3. Regardless of whether during the event or not, clearing "Special Dispatch Record: Rainy Town Shadow" will always grant "Posse: Mist's True Form."]]
  },
