  Activity_70438_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = [[
With the Spring Festival approaching, everyone is focused on the preparations for the celebration, paying no attention to the dark patches quietly squirming in the corners. The tiny prisoner liquefied and escaped its cage.
As dimensional rifts Blink, the black fur balls begin to Split... a sea of black Cats is Devouring the entire campus!
You wanted to look the other way and leave this bizarre incident for the school administration to handle.
But considering they drop Silver and gold vouchers, you changed your mind.]]
  },
  Activity_70438_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
The gameplay event "Uzzah Cat's Law" is available for a limited time! During the event, Keepers can beat up campus cats in "Chaotic Cat Dance" and earn large amounts of Silvers and Rose Scrip Coupons!

<Title:Event Duration>
January 24, 9:00 - February 5, 9:00 (GMT+8). During the event period, you can participate in the "Chaotic Cat Dance" levels unlocked each day. Completed levels cannot be replayed.

<Title:Chaotic Cat Dance>
1. "Chaotic Cat Dance" consists of 12 levels, with different levels opening daily. Completed levels cannot be replayed.
2. Each challenge does not consume Menophin, and upon completing one level, you will receive Pure Cores, Silvers, and Rose Scrip Coupons.
3. Alumni assistance is unavailable in these levels.
4. In the day's levels, each Awakener can only participate once.
5. Each day's levels require specific realms for challenges:
January 24: Chaos Realm
January 25: Aequor Realm
January 26: Caro Realm
January 27: Ultra Realm
January 28: No Restrictions
January 29: No Restrictions
January 30: Chaos Realm and Aequor Realm
January 31: Caro Realm and Ultra Realm
February 1: Chaos Realm and Caro Realm
February 2: Aequor Realm and Ultra Realm
February 3: Chaos Realm and Ultra Realm
February 4: Caro Realm and Aequor Realm]]
