  Activity_71095_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Participation Conditions>
Complete "Investigation Operation" 2-9 (Normal) to participate.
<Title:Investigation Event>
During the event period, a new investigation event from "Magic of Stories" will be launched daily. Keepers can unlock and investigate without consuming inventory. After completing the investigation event, rewards such as Pure Core, Investigation Badge, and Keeper's Experience can be obtained.
After the event ends, the investigation progress of "Magic of Stories" will be retained. Keepers can consume D-jewels in the Special Record to unlock uncompleted investigations. Completing uncompleted investigation events during the event period will also grant rewards consistent with those during the event.<Title:Limited Time Rewards>
Limited time rewards will be available during the event. Keepers can obtain Pure Core, Philosopher's Stone, and Silver after clearing "Magic of Stories" (Normal mode) and completing its investigation events! Limited time rewards are only available during the event period and cannot be completed or claimed after the event ends.]]
