  Activity_71098_ActivityName = {
    Text = "Half Step Away: Rerun"
  },
  Activity_71098_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = "She always stays ahead of the world.\nOne step, two steps—her footprints light the path for all.\nYet fools forget too easily:\nThe distance between genius and madness\nis but half a step."
  },
  Activity_71098_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "Event has Ended. Only \"Mentor's Teachings\" is currently available."
  },
  Activity_71098_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
During the event period, Keepers can collect event currency "Doll Parts" through the limited-time gameplay "Gate of Oblivion" and "Achievement Rewards". "Doll Parts" can be exchanged in "Mentor's Teachings" for rewards including the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "Shepherd's Staff," Lumen Cores, Pure Cores, Sage Stone Fragments, Mimetic Crystals, and more.

<Title:Gate of Oblivion>
1. "Gate of Oblivion" contains 9 material stages that involve direct battle without exploration, with one opening each day.
2. Each challenge consumes 120 Menophin, and successful challenges grant training materials and event currency.
3. After completing a stage, the "Re-enact" feature for that stage is unlocked. Note: The "Re-enact" feature does not grant Affinity.
4. You can use Alumni support to help you clear stages more easily.

<Title:Doll Parts Bonus>
1. Keepers possessing specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (no deployment required) can earn additional drop bonuses of "Doll Parts" in "Gate of Oblivion" stage rewards (including Re-enact). Specific bonuses are as follows:
Awakener "Doll: Inferno": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%
SSR Wheel of Destiny "Manikin of Oblivion": Ascension 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%
SR Wheel of Destiny "Shepherd's Staff": Ascension 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%
2. "Doll Parts Bonuses" from different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny are calculated cumulatively.
3. Specially, the rewards for the first clear of Madness difficulty will not be affected by these bonuses.

<Title:Mentor's Teachings>
1. Each "Exchange Parts" consumes 750 "Doll Parts," randomly granting five items from "Mentor's Teachings".
2. The item rewards in "Mentor's Teachings" are divided into "Special Items" and "Common Items". When resetting, the remaining quantity of special item rewards can be reset to the maximum. The specific rules are:
(1) First 5 resets: When "Special Items" are out of stock, Keepers can choose to reset, which will reset the remaining quantity of both "Special Items" and "Common Items" to the maximum; they can also continue exchanging. When "Common Items" are out of stock, a reset is required to continue exchanging.
(2) 6th reset and beyond: A reset can only be performed when "Common Items" are out of stock, and this will reset the remaining quantity of "Common Items" to maximum, while "Special Items" will not reset.

<Title:Event Duration>
1. June 16, 9:00 - June 30, 9:00 (GMT+8), all content from the Event Overview is available.
2. June 30, 9:00 - July 7, 9:00 (GMT+8), only "Mentor's Teachings" and "Achievement Rewards" remain, all other content ends and becomes inaccessible.
3. After July 7, 9:00 (GMT+8), any remaining unexchanged "Doll Parts" will be recycled at a rate of 40 Rose Scrips per part. Please check your mail, Keepers.]]
  },
