  Activity_71100_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event, Keepers can collect event currency "Weary Thoughts," "Sad Thoughts," and "Joyful Thoughts" through limited-time mechanics "Aequor Gaze" and "Achievement Rewards." Event currency can be used to purchase items in the "Abyssborn Epiphany," including the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "Azure Stone Throne," Luminous Core, Pure Core, Aetheric Shard, Mimetic Crystal, etc.
2. During the event, completing activity achievements will also grant the event-exclusive avatar "By the Silver Key: Caecus," the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "Azure Stone Throne," Silver, and a large amount of event currency!

<Title:Event Duration>
1. December 30, 9:00 - January 13, 9:00 (GMT+8), all event mechanics can be participated in.
2. January 13, 9:00 - January 20, 9:00 (GMT+8), only "Abyssborn Epiphany" and achievement rewards can be participated in.

<Title:Aequor Gaze>
1. "Aequor Gaze" has 5 levels, with 1 automatically opening every 2 days.
2. Each challenge will consume 120 Menophin, and a successful challenge will grant event currency.
3. Upon clearing a level, the "Reenact" function for that level will be unlocked. Please note: Using the "Reenact" function will not grant Affinity.
4. You can use Alumnis assistance to help you pass levels more easily.

<Title:Thought Bonus>
1. Keepers with specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be in the lineup) can make the event currency rewards for "Aequor Gaze" level tasks gain additional drop bonuses, with specific bonuses as follows:
Awakener "Tulu": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
SSR Wheel of Destiny "Hymn of the Sovereign": Stacks 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
SR Wheel of Destiny "Azure Stone Throne": Stacks 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
2. Different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny's "Thought Bonus" will be calculated additively.
3. Notably, the reward for the first clear of Madness difficulty challenges will not be affected by the "Thought Bonus".

<Title:Abyssborn Epiphany>
1. "Abyssborn Epiphany" is only open from December 30, 9:00 - January 20, 9:00 (GMT+8).
2. After January 20, 9:00 (GMT+8), any unexchanged "Weary Thoughts," "Sad Thoughts," and "Joyful Thoughts" will be reclaimed at a ratio of "40 Rose Scrip per exchange." Keepers are advised to check their mails for notifications.]]
