  Activity_72101_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event, Keepers can complete achievements in the "Achievement Rewards" by participating in "Traphase" and receive "Magic Acorns".
2. "Magic Acorns" can be redeemed for rich rewards in the "Turn Spectacular" including event-exclusive avatar "Reverse turn: Universal Card," 10 event-exclusive expressions, and "Shattered Remnant," "Stellar Remnant," etc.
3. During the event, "Multi-Link: Reverse turn" will be open for free!
4. During the event, Keepers who have cleared "Multi-Link: Reverse turn: Visitors from Another World," the battle background for "Traphase" will be temporarily replaced with "Reverse turn: Conscious Space".

<Title:Achievement Rewards>
1. "Achievement Rewards" includes "Awakener" victory achievements, "Wheel of destiny" victory achievements, "Posse" victory achievements, card play achievements; Keepers can receive "Magic Acorns" by completing achievements.
2. In "Traphase," use Awakeners from different professions, and every 25 cards played will earn 30 "Magic Acorns". Each profession's "play card" achievement can be completed up to 80 times.
3. "Awakener" achievements: Each "Awakener" can earn 10 "Magic Acorns" upon completing 1/3/6/10 victories in "Traphase".
4. "Wheel of destiny" achievements: Each "Wheel of destiny" can earn 10 "Magic Acorns" upon completing 1/3/6 victories in "Traphase".
5. "Posse" achievements: Each "Posse" can earn 10 "Magic Acorns" upon completing 1/3/6 victories in "Traphase".
6. "Awakeners," "Wheels of Destiny," and "Posse" temporarily unlocked by core themes will normally count victories and card plays during the event, but corresponding rewards can only be claimed after obtaining the respective "Awakener," "Wheel of destiny," "Posse".

<Title:turn Spectacular>
1. Keepers accumulate "Magic Acorns" to receive corresponding rewards, accumulating 2, 500 "Magic Acorns" provides all core rewards, and accumulating 5, 000 "Magic Acorns" allows you to claim all rewards!
2. After clearing "Reverse turn: Visitors from Another World," rewards for accumulating 100-900 "Magic Acorns" are unlocked, and after clearing "Reverse turn: The Moment of Reversal of Infinity," rewards for accumulating 1, 000-5, 000 "Magic Acorns" are unlocked.

<Title:Multi-Link>
1. During the event, "Multi-Link: Reverse turn" will be open for free.
2. During the event, "Reverse turn: Absolute Will" requires accumulating 1, 000 "Magic Acorns" to unlock.
3. After the event, the investigation progress of "Multi-Link: Reverse turn" will be retained. If "Multi-Link: Reverse turn" has not been unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked after the event by consuming "Reality Verge" *3.
4. Regardless of whether it is during the event, clearing "Multi-Link: Reverse turn" grants "Posse: Tavern Gate".

<Title:Event Duration>
This event will only be open from March 18, 9: 00 to April 1, 9: 00 (GMT+8). After April 1, 9: 00 (GMT+8), the event will end. Please remember to claim rewards in "Turn Spectacular" before the event ends!]]
  },
