  Activity_73879_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "Event has Ended. Only \"Celestial Gestation\" is currently available."
  },
  Activity_73879_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event period, Keepers can collect three types of "Embryos" through the limited-time gameplay "Dark Womb" and "Achievement Rewards." These "Embryos" can be exchanged for item rewards in the "Holy Embryo Hatching," including event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "Slumbering Under the Glacier," Pure Core, Lumen Core, Sage Shards, Mimic Frost Crystal, and more.
2. During the event period, completing tasks in the "Achievement Rewards" will grant the event-exclusive avatar frame "By the Silver Key: Murphy," the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "Slumbering Under the Glacier," and a large number of "Embryos."

<Title:Event Duration>
1. From March 10th 9:00 to March 24th 9:00 (GMT+8), all event content is available.
2. From March 24th 9:00 to March 31st 9:00 (GMT+8), only the "Holy Embryo Hatching" and "Achievement Rewards" will remain, all other content will conclude and be unavailable for participation.

<Title:Dark Womb>
1. The "Dark Womb" contains 7 stages, with one unlocking automatically each day.
2. Each challenge will exhaust 120 Menophin. Success in challenges will reward you with event currency "Embryo of Ignorance," "Embryo of Desirelessness," and "Embryo of Insatiability."
3. Upon clearing a stage, the "Re-enact" function is unlocked for that stage. Note: You cannot gain Affinity from using the "Re-enact" function.
4. You can use Alumni assistance to help you clear stages more easily.
5. After clearing a stage at any difficulty, the Madness difficulty of that stage will unlock. Completing the Madness difficulty for the first time will reward you with ample event currency.
6. Please note: Madness difficulty challenges do not exhaust Menophin, cannot be re-enacted, and repeating challenges after the first completion will not reward additional event currency.

<Title:Embryo Bonuses>
1. Keepers possessing specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be in the lineup) can enhance the drop rate of "Embryo of Ignorance," "Embryo of Desirelessness," and "Embryo of Insatiability" as stage rewards in the "Dark Womb" (including re-enactment). Specific bonuses are as follows:
Awakener "Murphy": At Enlighten 0/1/2/3 or above, bonuses are 20%/30%/40%/50%
SSR Wheel of Destiny "Hidden Birth": At stacks 0/1/2/3 or above, bonuses are 20%/30%/40%/50%
SR Wheel of Destiny "Slumbering Under the Glacier": At stacks 0/1/2/3 or above, bonuses are 20%/30%/40%/50%
2. Bonuses for different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny are cumulative.
3. Specifically, the reward for the first-time Madness difficulty challenge is not affected by "Embryo Bonuses."

<Title:Holy Embryo Hatching>
1. "Holy Embryo Hatching" is only open from March 10th 9:00 to March 31st 9:00 (GMT+8).
2. After March 31st 9:00 (GMT+8), any unexchanged "Embryos" will be reclaimed at a rate of "Rose Scrip Voucher *40" per embryo. Please, Keepers, remember to check your mail.]]
  },
