  Activity_74364_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "The event has ended. Currently, only \"Lucky Club\" is available."
  },
  Activity_74364_ActivityTips = {
    Text = "<Title:Event Overview>\n1. During the event, Keepers can collect the event currency \"Winning Chips\" through the limited-time gameplay \"Moonlit Tales\" and \"Achievement Rewards\". \"Winning Chips\" can be exchanged for rich rewards in the \"Lucky Club,\" including the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny \"Fate Roulette,\" Pure Core, Luminous Core, Aetheric Shards, and Mimetic Crystal, etc.\n2. During the event, completing tasks in \"Achievement Rewards\" will grant the event-exclusive avatar \"By the Silver Key: Ryker,\" the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny \"Fate Roulette,\" Silver Core, and a large amount of the event currency \"Winning Chips\".\n3. During the event, \"Special Task Record: Happy Hunting!\" will be available for free.\n\n<Title:Event Duration>\n1. September 22, 9:00 - October 6, 9:00 (GMT+8): All event content is accessible.\n2. October 6, 9:00 - October 13, 9:00 (GMT+8): Only the \"Lucky Club\" and \"Achievement Rewards\" remain available; other content has ended and is no longer accessible.\n\n<Title:Moonlit Tales>\n1. \"Moonlit Tales\" consists of 9 levels, one of which will automatically open each day.\n2. Each challenge consumes 120 points of Menophin, and challenging different levels yields different material drops as well as the event currency \"Winning Chips\".\n3. This event's levels are combat-related material levels and can be \"replayed\" after clearing! Each \"replay\" consumes 120 points of Menophin.\n4. Note: When using the \"replay\" feature, no Affinity will be gained.\n\n<Title:Chip Bonus>\n1. Keepers with specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be on the lineup) receive additional drops of \"Winning Chips\" in \"Moonlit Tales\" level task rewards (including replays), as follows:\nAwakener \"Ryker\": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus of 20%/30%/40%/50%\nSSR Wheel of Destiny \"Hour of Fortune\": Stacking 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus of 20%/30%/40%/50%\nSR Wheel of Destiny \"Fate Roulette\": Stacking 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus of 20%/30%/40%/50%\n2. The \"Chip Bonus\" from different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny is calculated cumulatively.\n3. Notably, the initial challenge rewards for \"Madness\" difficulty are not affected by the \"Chip Bonus\".\n\n<Title:Lucky Club>\n1. The \"Lucky Club\" is open only from September 22, 9:00 - October 13, 9:00 (GMT+8).\n2. After October 13, 9:00 (GMT+8), any remaining unexchanged \"Winning Chips\" will be recycled at a rate of \"Rose Scrip ×40\" per chip. Keepers are advised to check their mail.\n\n<Title:Special Task Record>\n1. During the event, \"Special Task Record: Happy Hunting!\" will be available for free.\n2. After the event ends, the investigation progress for \"Special Task Record: Happy Hunting!\" will be retained. If \"Special Task Record: Happy Hunting!\" was not unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked after the event ends by consuming \"Reality Verge\" ×7.\n3. Regardless of whether during the event period or not, clearing \"Special Task Record: Happy Hunting!\" will grant \"Posse: A Gun's Cry\".\n\n<Title:Rerun Compensation>\n1. Keepers who have previously unlocked \"Special Task Record: Happy Hunting!\" and unlock it again during this rerun event will receive compensation of \"Winning Chips\" ×700.\n2. Keepers who have previously obtained the event-exclusive avatar \"By the Silver Key: Ryker\" will have it automatically converted to \"Nameless One's Invitation\" ×1 upon obtaining it again."
  },
