  },
  Activity_78791_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event, Keepers can collect three types of "Bud" through the limited-time gameplay "Beast Ambition" and "Achievement Rewards." These "Buds" can be exchanged in "Mountain Gorge" for item rewards, including the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "When the Snow Mountain Melts," Pure Core, Luminous Core, Wise Stone Shards, and Mimic Crystal.
2. During the event, "Special Dispatch Record: Elworth's Returnee" will be opened for free.

<Title:Event Duration>
1. From May 19, 9:00 AM to June 2, 9:00 AM (GMT+8), all event content is available to participate.
2. From June 2, 9:00 AM to June 9, 9:00 AM (GMT+8), only "Mountain Gorge" and "Achievement Rewards" remain, other content has ended and cannot be participated in.

<Title:Beast Ambition>
1. "Beast Ambition" includes 5 levels, one unlocking every 2 days automatically.
2. Each challenge consumes 120 Menophin, and successful challenges will earn the event currency "Frozen Bud," "Silver Frost Bud," and "Sunlight Bud."
3. After clearing the level, the "Replay" function is unlocked for that level. Note: Using the "Replay" function will not earn Affinity.
4. You can use Alumni aids and "Resonance: Devour the Mountain" to help clear levels more easily.
5. On the second day after unlocking, the Madness difficulty of the level is unlocked. Completing Madness difficulty for the first time earns substantial event currency rewards.
6. Note: Madness difficulty challenges do not consume Menophin, cannot be replayed, and repeating challenges after the first will not earn event currency rewards.

<Title:Bud Bonus>
1. Keepers with specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to deploy) can gain additional drop bonuses (including replay) for "Frozen Bud," "Silver Frost Bud," and "Sunlight Bud" in "Beast Ambition" level rewards, as follows:
Awakener "Helot: Catena": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 or above bonus of 20%/30%/40%/50%
SSR Wheel of Destiny "Sunk into Crimson": Stack position 0/1/2/3 or above bonus of 20%/30%/40%/50%
SR Wheel of Destiny "When the Snow Mountain Melts": Stack position 0/1/2/3 or above bonus of 20%/30%/40%/50%
2. Different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny "Bud Bonus" are settled in an accumulative manner.
3. Especially, the first-time challenge reward of Madness difficulty is not affected by the "Bud Bonus."

<Title:Resonance: Devour the Mountain>
1. Keepers can obtain "Heart of Devour" by completing activity achievements.
2. Consuming the "Heart of Devour" to activate "Resonance: Devour the Mountain" can make Keepers stronger in the "Beast Ambition" gameplay, making challenges easier.

<Title:Mountain Gorge>
1. There are three exchange shops in "Mountain Gorge," opening times are as follows:
"Appetite of Devouring" opens at 9 AM on May 19.
"Battle Will of Revenge" opens at 9 AM on May 21.
"Resurrection Hope" opens at 9 AM on May 23.
2. Each exchange consumes 750 "Frozen Bud"/"Silver Frost Bud"/"Sunlight Bud" and randomly rewards five items from the exchange shop.
3. Each exchange shop's item rewards are divided into "Special Items" and "Common Items." Upon reset, the remaining quantity of special items' rewards can be reset to the limit. Specific rules are as follows:
(1) First 2 resets: When "Special Items" have no remaining quantity, Keepers can choose to reset. After resetting, both "Special Items" and "Common Items" remaining amounts will reset to the limit; or continue exchanging until "Common Items" also have no remaining quantity before a reset is required to continue exchanging.
(2) From the 3rd reset: Can only reset when "Common Items" have no remaining quantity. Reset will restore the remaining quantity of "Common Items" to the limit, "Special Items" will no longer reset.
4. After June 9, 9:00 AM (GMT+8), unexchanged "Buds" will be reclaimed at the ratio of each exchange for "Rose Scrip*40." Please check mails carefully.

<Title:Special Dispatch Record>
1. During the event, "Special Dispatch Record: Elworth's Returnee" will be open for free. Clearing "Special Dispatch Record: Elworth's Returnee" will grant event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "When the Snow Mountain Melts" rewards in the achievement rewards, which are only available during the event. After the event, it cannot be completed or claimed.
2. After the event, the investigation progress of "Special Dispatch Record: Elworth's Returnee" will be retained. If not unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked after the event by consuming "Reality Verge"*7.
3. Regardless of the event period, clearing "Special Dispatch Record: Elworth's Returnee" will grant "Posse: Awakening of the Mountains."]]
  },
