  Activity_81019_ActivityName = {
    Text = "Mop & Wonder"
  },
  Activity_81019_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = [[
Who traverses the dreamlike Kadath, cleaning up refuse for their master?
It's Karen~ It's Karen!
Clearing Dissolution~ Dream Ventilation~ Dimension Disinfection~ Making everything squeaky clean~
