  },
  Activity_81019_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event, Keepers can participate in "Sweep Progress" and claim "Sweep Tools."
2. Once enough "Sweep Tools" have been accumulated, generous rewards can be claimed from "Dust-Busting Allowance," including the event-exclusive avatar "Cleaning Master," Silver, Pure Core, Aetheric Shard, and more.

<Title: Sweep Progress>
1. "Sweep Progress" contains multiple types of Sweep tasks. Keepers can complete Sweep tasks to claim "Sweep Tools." An extra reward is available each day after completing all types of Sweep tasks!
2. During the event, completing each type of Sweep task for the first time will trigger a hidden Story scene.
3. "Sweep Progress" will Refresh and reset daily at 9:00 (GMT+8) during the event.

<Title: Dust-Busting Allowance>
1. Keepers can claim corresponding rewards by accumulating "Sweep Tools." Generous supply rewards are available for every 1,000 "Sweep Tools" reached. Accumulating a total of 10,000 "Sweep Tools" grants the Mop & Wonder exclusive avatar "Cleaning Master."

<Title:Karen's Gratitude>
During the event, check in at "Karen's Gratitude" to claim the gifts Karen has prepared for Keepers!

<Title:Event Duration>
This event is only available from April 28 9:00 - May 12 9:00 (GMT+8). The event ends on May 12 at 9:00 (GMT+8). Don't forget to claim your rewards from "Dust-Busting Allowance," Keepers!]]
  },
