  Activity_81178_ActivityName = {
    Text = "Beneath the Tempest"
  },
  Activity_81178_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = [[
Torrential rain poured from the ashen sky, lashing the sea into a crackling frenzy.
Merciless lightning roared at will, heralding the arrival of boundless Horror beneath the waves.
The glorious Nautilus swayed Fragile as a tottering Infant amidst the surging billows.
None knew what Fate awaited them, just as it is only when the capricious sea unleashes its Anger that one truly grasps how insignificant they are.]]
  },
  Activity_81178_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "Event has Ended. Only \"Crewmates' Treasures\" is currently available."
  },
  Activity_81178_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
During the event period, Keepers can collect event currency "Signal Flags" through the limited-time gameplay modes "Lost in Deep Sea" and "Achievement Rewards." Signal Flags can be used to exchange for rewards in "Crewmates' Treasures," including the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "Navigator at Sea," Luminous Core, Pure Core, Aetheric Shards, and Mimetic Crystals, etc.

<Title:Lost in Deep Sea>
1. "Lost in Deep Sea" includes 9 material stages that do not require exploration and are directly combat-based, with one stage opening each day.
2. Each challenge will consume 120 Menophin. A successful challenge will reward cultivation materials and event currency.
3. After completing a stage, the "Reenact" function for that stage will be unlocked. Note: Using the "Reenact" function does not grant any Affinity.
4. You can use Support Awakener to help you pass the stages more easily.

<Title:Signal Flag Bonus>
1. Keepers who own specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be engaged) can receive additional drops of "Signal Flags" from "Lost in Deep Sea" stage rewards (including reenacts). The specific bonuses are as follows:
Awakener "Corposant": Enlighten Level 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%
SSR Wheel of Destiny "Flamebound Navigator": Ascension Level 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%
SR Wheel of Destiny "Navigator at Sea": Ascension Level 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%
2. The "Signal Flag Bonus" from different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny is cumulative.
3. Notably, the first clear reward for Madness difficulty challenges is not affected by the aforementioned bonuses.

<Title:Crewmates' Treasures>
1. Each "Deliver Flags" will consume 750 "Signal Flags" and randomly award five items from "Crewmates' Treasures."
2. The item rewards from "Crewmates' Treasures" are divided into "Special Items" and "Common Items." When resetting, the remaining quantity of special items can be reset to the maximum limit, with the following rules:
(1) First 5 resets: When there are no remaining "Special Items," Keepers can choose to reset, which will reset both "Special Items" and "Common Items" to their maximum limits; they can also choose to continue exchanging until there are no remaining "Common Items," at which point a reset is required to continue exchanging.
(2) 6th and subsequent resets: Resets can only be performed when there are no remaining "Common Items." Resetting will reset the remaining quantity of "Common Items" to the maximum limit, but "Special Items" will no longer be reset.

<Title:Event Schedule>
1. May 5, 9:00 - May 19, 9:00 (GMT+8), all content mentioned in the event overview is available.
2. May 19, 9:00 - May 26, 9:00 (GMT+8), only "Crewmates' Treasures" and "Achievement Rewards" remain available, while other content has ended and cannot be participated in.
3. After May 26, 9:00 (GMT+8), any remaining unexchanged "Signal Flags" will be reclaimed at a rate of 40 Rose Scrip per flag. Please check your mail, Keepers.]]
  },
