    Text = "Glimpse Beyond Sanctum"
  },
  Activity_81771_ActivityPlot = {
    Text = [[
No one has seen the holy brilliance of the Divine Realm, but from the accidentally leaked truths, people can sense the shadow of the Divine Realm.
It exists there, always there, and countless devoted believers will make it truly arrive.
No matter the grave sins that must be committed as a price.]]
