  Activity_81771_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "The event has ended."
  },
  Activity_81771_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Bleak Tide>
"Bleak Tide" consists of 7 stages, with the first 3 opening on the event's first day and 1 unlocking every 3 days thereafter. Each stage offers unique generous rewards!
Each type of "Bleak Tide" contains numerous clusters. When any Keeper successfully challenges a cluster type, that type's cluster count decreases by 1. Once all clusters of a type are eliminated, the corresponding stage will close permanently.
Each Keeper can repel "Bleak Tide" clusters up to 20 times daily, with resets at 9:00 AM (GMT+8) during the event period.
Each stage provides different Relics offering powerful buffs.
Assistance must be selected for all stages. Throughout the event, mutually followed Keepers can only provide assistance once.
Keepers must complete Investigation Operation 2-9 to participate in this event.

<Title:Level Compensation>
The "Glimpse Beyond Sanctum: Bleak Tide" features a level compensation system to help all Keepers resist the invasion together!
The compensation rules are as follows:
Any Awakener in the investigation team below level 60 will be compensated to level 60 during this challenge.
Any Awakener in the investigation team with skill level below 5 will be compensated to level 5 during this challenge.
Any Awakener in the investigation team with "Madness Omens" below level 6 will be compensated to level 6 during this challenge.
Any Awakener in the investigation team with "Soulforge Aptitude" below level 5 will be compensated to level 5 during this challenge.
If the Keeper's level is below 60, they will be compensated to level 60 during this challenge.

<Title:Timed Tasks>
During the event, repelling the Bleak Tide 30 times will complete timed tasks and reward you with "Basic Skin Voucher (Phase 1)" *1!
From May 26, 9:00 - June 9, 9:00 (GMT+8), you can use the "Basic Skin Voucher (Phase 1)" in the "Store: Skin Order" to exchange for basic skins.
Learn more about ways to obtain the "Basic Skin Voucher (Phase 1)" through community channels and announcements.]]
  },
