  Activity_89730_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "Event has ended. Currently, only \"Thirst for Knowledge\" can be participated in."
  },
  Activity_89730_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event, Keepers can collect event currencies "Book of Knowledge," "Book of Mathematics," and "Book of Literature" through limited-time gameplay "Beyond the Skies," "Dreamscape Patrol," and "Achievement Rewards." These currencies can be used to purchase items in "Thirst for Knowledge," including the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "Lone Feather," Luminous Core, Pure Core, etc.
2. During the event, "Dreamscape: Beyond the Skies Part I" is available for limited free access, and completing the event achievements will also grant the exclusive event avatar "By the Silver Key: Castor"!

<Title:Event Duration>
1. June 2nd 9:00 - June 16th 9:00 (GMT+8), all event gameplay is available for participation.
2. June 16th 9:00 - June 23rd 9:00 (GMT+8), only "Thirst for Knowledge" and Achievement Rewards are available for participation.

<Title:Beyond the Skies>
1. "Beyond the Skies" consists of 7 levels, with 1 level automatically opening every day.
2. Each challenge will consume 120 Menophin, and successful challenges will yield event currency.
3. After completing a level, the "Revisit" feature for that level will be unlocked. Please note: using the "Revisit" feature will not yield Affinity.
4. You can use Alumni assistance to help you clear levels more easily.

<Title:Thirst for Knowledge>
"Thirst for Knowledge" has three shops, opening at the following times:
"General Elective Course": Opens at 9:00 AM on June 2nd.
"Science Elective Course": Opens at 9:00 AM on June 4th.
"Literature Elective Course": Opens at 9:00 AM on June 6th.
You can select and purchase items directly within the shops.

<Title:Event Bonuses>
1. Keepers with specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be deployed) can receive additional drop bonuses for the "Book of Knowledge," "Book of Mathematics," and "Book of Literature" rewards in the "Beyond the Skies" level tasks, with specific bonuses as follows:
Awakener "Castor": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
SSR Wheel of Destiny "Unbearable Freedom": Affinity 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
SR Wheel of Destiny "Lone Feather": Affinity 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
2. Different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny's "Event Bonuses" are calculated additively.
3. Notably, the rewards for the first successful challenge of the Madness difficulty will not be affected by "Event Bonuses."

<Title:Dreamscape Patrol>
1. You will automatically receive 60 "Book of Knowledge" every hour, with a maximum storage of 25 hours.

<Title:Dreamscape>
1. During the event, "Dreamscape: Beyond the Skies Part I" can be unlocked for free.
