  Activity_95191_ActivityStageEndContent = {
    Text = "Event has Ended. Only \"A Hidden Base\" is currently available."
  },
  Activity_95191_ActivityTips = {
    Text = [[
<Title:Event Overview>
1. During the event period, Keepers can collect event currency "Seal" of Wealth, "Seal" of Death, and "Seal" of War through limited-time gameplay "Hunt of the Charred," "The Quiet Campfire," and "Achievement Rewards." These currencies can be used to purchase items in "A Hidden Base," including the event-exclusive SR Wheel of Destiny "Impending Sun," Luminous Core, Pure Core, and more.
2. During the event period, "Everburning Vex" will be available for free, and completing event achievements will also grant the event-exclusive avatar "By the Silver Key: Kathigu-Ra"!

<Title:Event Duration>
1. August 18 9:00 - September 1 9:00 (GMT+8), all event gameplay available.
2. September 1 9:00 - September 8 9:00 (GMT+8), only "A Hidden Base" and Achievement Rewards available.

<Title:Hunt of the Charred>
1. "Hunt of the Charred" contains 7 stages, with 1 stage automatically unlocked every day.
2. Each challenge consumes 120 Menophin, and successful completion grants event currency.
3. Upon clearing a stage, its "Reenact" function is unlocked. Please note: No Affinity is gained when using the "Reenact" function.
4. You may use Alumnis for assistance to make clearing easier.

<Title>A Hidden Base>
There are three shops in "A Hidden Base," with opening times as follows:
Treasure Vault: Opens at 9:00 on August 18.
Commission Room: Opens at 9:00 on August 20.
War Camp: Opens at 9:00 on August 22.
You can select and directly purchase items in the shops.

<Title:Event Bonuses>
1. Possessing specific Awakener or Wheel of Destiny (not required to be deployed) grants bonus drops of "Seal" of Wealth, "Seal" of Death, and "Seal" of War in "Hunt of the Charred" stage rewards. Specific bonuses are as follows:
Awakener "Kathigu-Ra": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 and above, grants 20%/30%/40%/50% bonus.
SSR Wheel of Destiny "Amber-Tinted Death": Ascension 0/1/2/3 and above, grants 20%/30%/40%/50% bonus.
SR Wheel of Destiny "Impending Sun": Ascension 0/1/2/3 and above, grants 20%/30%/40%/50% bonus.
2. Bonuses from different Awakener or Wheel of Destiny stack.
3. Special note: First-clear rewards for Madness difficulty are not affected by event bonuses.

<Title:The Quiet Campfire>
1. Automatically gain 60 "Seal" of Wealth every hour, with a maximum storage of 25 hours.

<Title:Psyche Deepdive>
1. During the event, "Everburning Vex" can be unlocked for free.
2. After the event ends, the investigation progress of "Everburning Vex" will be retained. Completing unfinished investigation events after the event will also grant the same investigation rewards as during the event. If "Everburning Vex" was not unlocked during the event, it can still be unlocked by consuming 3 Reality Verge after the event.
3. Regardless of whether it is during the event or not, clearing "Psyche Deepdive: Everburning Vex" grants the "Posse: Undying Sun."]]
  },
