    Text = "A cataclysm of color, a frenzy of form.\nAn almost familiar canvas, stained in brushstrokes of blood,\nWhere beneath the palette knife, souls tremble and whisper from the canvas's dark side.\nThe most real and perfect art lies hidden behind the veil of madness,\nFor only by rending that chaotic façade can one glimpse the world's raw, inner face."
