2. September 22nd, 9:00 - September 29th, 9:00 (GMT+8), only "Pickman's Studio" and Achievement Rewards can be participated in.

<Title:Bizarre Sketch>
1. "Bizarre Sketch" consists of 7 levels, with 1 level automatically unlocked each day.
2. Each challenge will consume 120 Menophin, and successful challenges will reward event currency.
3. After clearing a level, the "Reenact" function for that level will be unlocked. Please note: using the "Reenact" function will not yield Affinity.
4. You can use Alumnis assistance to help you clear levels more easily.

<Title:Pickman's Studio>
1. "Pickman's Studio" has three shops, which open at the following times:
 "Truth Studio": Opens at 9:00 AM on September 8th.
 "Dreams Studio": Opens at 9:00 AM on September 10th.
 "Madness Studio": Opens at 9:00 AM on September 12th.
2. Each exchange will consume 750 "Paint of Truth"/"Paint of Dreams"/"Paint of Madness," randomly granting five item rewards from the studio.
3. The item rewards from each studio are divided into "Special Items" and "Normal Items." During resets, the remaining quantity of special item rewards can be reset to the maximum limit, with specific rules as follows:
(1) For the first two resets: when there are no remaining special items, Keepers can choose to reset, which will reset the remaining quantities of both "Special Items" and "Normal Items" to the maximum limit; they can also choose to continue exchanging. When there are no remaining normal items, a reset must be performed to continue exchanging.
(2) From the third reset onward: a reset can only be performed when there are no remaining normal items, which will reset the remaining quantities of normal items to the maximum limit. Special items will no longer be reset.

<Title:Event Bonuses>
1. Keepers possessing specific Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny (not required to be deployed) can receive additional drop bonuses for "Paint of Truth," "Paint of Dreams," and "Paint of Madness" in the task rewards of "Bizarre Sketch." The specific bonuses are as follows:
 Awakener "Pickman": Enlighten 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
