 SR Wheel of Destiny "Thirsting Brush": Ascension 0/1/2/3 and above, bonus 20%/30%/40%/50%.
2. The "Event Bonuses" from different Awakeners or Wheels of Destiny are calculated in an additive manner.
3. Notably, the first-time challenge rewards for Madness Difficulty will not be affected by "Event Bonuses."

<Title:Psyche Deepdive>
